"5622","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Baqi mein aik shakhs ne doosrey shakhs ko ya abul-Qasim keh kar awaz di, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (is awaz par) us ( aadmi ( ki taraf mutwajjeh huey to us shakhs ne kaha : Allah ke rasool! mera maqsud aapko pukaarna na tha, maine to falan ko awaz di hai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par (apni ( kunniyat na rakho."
"5623","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Baqi mein aik shakhs ne doosrey shakhs ko ya abul-Qasim keh kar awaz di, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (is awaz par) us ( aadmi ( ki taraf mutwajjeh huey to us shakhs ne kaha : Allah ke rasool! mera maqsud aapko pukaarna na tha, maine to falan ko awaz di hai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par (apni ( kunniyat na rakho."
"5624","Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tumharey naamon mein se Allah Taala ke nazdeek sabse zyada pasandida naam Abdullah aur Abdur-Rehman hain."
"5625","Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tumharey naamon mein se Allah Taala ke nazdeek sabse zyada pasandida naam Abdullah aur Abdur-Rehman hain."
"5626","Mansoor ne Saalim-bin abi Jaad se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : ham ( Ansar ( mein se aik shakhs ke yahan ladka paida hua, us ne uska naam Muhammad rakha, uski qaum ne us se kaha : tum ne apne betey ka naam Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke naam par rakha hai, ham tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke naam par naam nahi rakhney dengey , wo shakhs apne betey ko apni peeth par utha kar) kandhey par chadha kar) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha : Allah ke rasool! mere yahan aik ladka paida hua hai maine iska naam Muhammad rakha hai, is par meri qaum ne kaha hai : ham tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke naam par naam nahi rakhney dengey. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par (apni ( kunniyat na rakho . beshak main taqseem karne wala hun (jo Allah ata karta hai, usey ( tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun."
"5627","Mansoor ne Saalim-bin abi Jaad se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : ham ( Ansar ( mein se aik shakhs ke yahan ladka paida hua, us ne uska naam Muhammad rakha, uski qaum ne us se kaha : tum ne apne betey ka naam Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke naam par rakha hai, ham tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke naam par naam nahi rakhney dengey , wo shakhs apne betey ko apni peeth par utha kar) kandhey par chadha kar) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha : Allah ke rasool! mere yahan aik ladka paida hua hai maine iska naam Muhammad rakha hai, is par meri qaum ne kaha hai : ham tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke naam par naam nahi rakhney dengey. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par (apni ( kunniyat na rakho . beshak main taqseem karne wala hun (jo Allah ata karta hai, usey ( tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun."
"5628","Husain ne Saalim-bin abi Jaad se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : ham ( Ansar ( mein se aik shakhs ke yahan ladka paida hua us ne uska naam Muhammad rakha ham ne us se kaha : ham tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki kunniyat se nahi pukaarengey. yahan tak ke tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se (is baat ki) ijazat ley lo. so wo shakhs Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha ke uske yahaan ladka paida hua hai, to maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke naam par uska naam rakha hai aur meri qaum ne is baat se inkar kar diya hai ke mujhey uske naam ki kunniyat se pukaarein yahan tak ke tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat ley lo. to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere naam par naam rakho lekin meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho, beshak main Qasim bana kar bheja gaya hun, tumharey darmyan (Allah ka diya hua fazal) taqseem karta hun."
"5629","Husain ne Saalim-bin abi Jaad se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : ham ( Ansar ( mein se aik shakhs ke yahan ladka paida hua us ne uska naam Muhammad rakha ham ne us se kaha : ham tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki kunniyat se nahi pukaarengey. yahan tak ke tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se (is baat ki) ijazat ley lo. so wo shakhs Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha ke uske yahaan ladka paida hua hai, to maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke naam par uska naam rakha hai aur meri qaum ne is baat se inkar kar diya hai ke mujhey uske naam ki kunniyat se pukaarein yahan tak ke tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat ley lo. to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere naam par naam rakho lekin meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho, beshak main Qasim bana kar bheja gaya hun, tumharey darmyan (Allah ka diya hua fazal) taqseem karta hun."
"5630","Khalid Tahan ne Husain se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur main Qasim ( taqseem karne wala ( bana kar bheja gaya hun, tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun ke alfaz zikr nahi kiye."
"5631","Khalid Tahan ne Husain se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur main Qasim ( taqseem karne wala ( bana kar bheja gaya hun, tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun ke alfaz zikr nahi kiye."
"5632","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba aur abu-Saeed ashajj ne kaha : hamein Wakee ne hadis bayan ki kaha : hamein Aamash ne Saalim-bin abi Jaad se hadis sunai unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho, kyonke main hi abul-Qaasim hon tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun aur Abu-Bakar ki riwayat mein hai : apni kunniyat na rakho."
"5633","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba aur abu-Saeed ashajj ne kaha : hamein Wakee ne hadis bayan ki kaha : hamein Aamash ne Saalim-bin abi Jaad se hadis sunai unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho, kyonke main hi abul-Qaasim hon tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun aur Abu-Bakar ki riwayat mein hai : apni kunniyat na rakho."
"5634","abu-Muawiya ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur kaha : Qasim banaya gaya hun tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun."
"5635","abu-Muawiya ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur kaha : Qasim banaya gaya hun tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun."
"5636","Muhammad-bin-Musanna aur Muhammad-bin Bishr ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba ne hadis sunai unhon-ne kaha : maine Qatada se suna, unhon-ne Salim se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Ansar mein se aik shakhs ke yahan ladka paida hua us ne uska naam Muhammad rakhna chaha to wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur aap se puchha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Ansar ne achchha kya, mere naam par naam rakho, meri kunniyat par (apni ( kunniyat na rakho."
"5637","Muhammad-bin-Musanna aur Muhammad-bin Bishr ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba ne hadis sunai unhon-ne kaha : maine Qatada se suna, unhon-ne Salim se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Ansar mein se aik shakhs ke yahan ladka paida hua us ne uska naam Muhammad rakhna chaha to wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur aap se puchha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Ansar ne achchha kya, mere naam par naam rakho, meri kunniyat par (apni ( kunniyat na rakho."
"5638","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba , Muhammad-bin-Musanna , Muhammad-bin Amr bin jabla aur Bishr bin Khalid ne Muhammad-bin-Jafar se. Muhammad-bin-Jafar, ibne-abi Adi aur Nazar-bin-Shumail ne Shoba se, unhon-ne Qatada Mansoor Sulaiman aur Husain-bin-Abdur-Rehman se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : ham ne Saalim-bin abi Jaad se suna, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, jis tarah un sab ki riwayat hai, jinki hadis ham pahley bayan kar chukey hain, Shoba se nazar ki bayan ki hui hadis mein hai kaha : usmein Husain aur Sulaiman ne izafa kya, Husain ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mujhey Qasim bana kar bheja gaya hai, main tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun. padhi. aur Sulaiman ne kaha : main hi Qasim hon, tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun."
"5639","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba , Muhammad-bin-Musanna , Muhammad-bin Amr bin jabla aur Bishr bin Khalid ne Muhammad-bin-Jafar se. Muhammad-bin-Jafar, ibne-abi Adi aur Nazar-bin-Shumail ne Shoba se, unhon-ne Qatada Mansoor Sulaiman aur Husain-bin-Abdur-Rehman se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : ham ne Saalim-bin abi Jaad se suna, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, jis tarah un sab ki riwayat hai, jinki hadis ham pahley bayan kar chukey hain, Shoba se nazar ki bayan ki hui hadis mein hai kaha : usmein Husain aur Sulaiman ne izafa kya, Husain ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mujhey Qasim bana kar bheja gaya hai, main tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun. padhi. aur Sulaiman ne kaha : main hi Qasim hon, tumharey darmyan taqseem karta hun."
"5640","Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne kaha : hamein ( Muhammad (bin Munkadir ne hadis sunai ke unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna, ham mein se aik shakhs ke yahan aik ladka paida hua, us shakhs ne iska naam Qasim rakha, ham ne kaha : ham tumhen abul-Qaasim ki kunniyat se nahi pukaarengey. na (tumhari ye khahish poori karke) tumhari aankhen thandi karengey to wo shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye sab baat batai to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum apne betey ka naam Abdur-Rehman rakh lo."
"5641","Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne kaha : hamein ( Muhammad (bin Munkadir ne hadis sunai ke unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna, ham mein se aik shakhs ke yahan aik ladka paida hua, us shakhs ne iska naam Qasim rakha, ham ne kaha : ham tumhen abul-Qaasim ki kunniyat se nahi pukaarengey. na (tumhari ye khahish poori karke) tumhari aankhen thandi karengey to wo shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye sab baat batai to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum apne betey ka naam Abdur-Rehman rakh lo."
"5642","Rooh bin-Qasim ne Muhammad-bin Munkadir se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis ki tarah hadis bayan ki, magar unhon-ne ye alfaz nahi kahey : aur ham tumhari aankhen thandi nahi karengey."
"5643","Rooh bin-Qasim ne Muhammad-bin Munkadir se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis ki tarah hadis bayan ki, magar unhon-ne ye alfaz nahi kahey : aur ham tumhari aankhen thandi nahi karengey."
"5644","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba , Amr Naqid , Zuhair-bin-Harab , aur ibne-Numair ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne Ayub se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Muhammad-bin Sirin se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna : abul-Qasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho . Amr ne kaha Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai kaha aur maine suna nahi kaha."
"5645","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba , Amr Naqid , Zuhair-bin-Harab , aur ibne-Numair ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne Ayub se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Muhammad-bin Sirin se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna : abul-Qasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho . Amr ne kaha Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai kaha aur maine suna nahi kaha."
"5646","saiyedna Mughira-bin-Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke jab main Najran mein aaya, to wahan ke) nasrani ( logon ne mujh par aetraz kya ke tum padhtey ho ke) aayat ( ''aey Harun ki behan '' ( Maryam : 28 ( (yani Maryam (Alaihissalam) ko Harun ki behan kaha hai) halanke ( saiyedna Harun (Alaihissalam) Musa (Alaihissalam) ke bhai they aur) Musa (Alaihissalam) , Esa (Alaihissalam) se itni muddat pahley they ( phir Maryam (Alaihissalam) Harun (Alaihissalam) ki behan kyonkar ho sakti hain?) , jab main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya to maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke (ye wo Harun thodi hain jo Musa ke bhai they) Bani-Israeel ki aadat thi (jaisey ab sab ki aadat hai) ke wo paighambaron aur agley nekon ke naam par naam rakhtey they."
"5647","saiyedna Mughira-bin-Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke jab main Najran mein aaya, to wahan ke) nasrani ( logon ne mujh par aetraz kya ke tum padhtey ho ke) aayat ( ''aey Harun ki behan '' ( Maryam : 28 ( (yani Maryam (Alaihissalam) ko Harun ki behan kaha hai) halanke ( saiyedna Harun (Alaihissalam) Musa (Alaihissalam) ke bhai they aur) Musa (Alaihissalam) , Esa (Alaihissalam) se itni muddat pahley they ( phir Maryam (Alaihissalam) Harun (Alaihissalam) ki behan kyonkar ho sakti hain?) , jab main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya to maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke (ye wo Harun thodi hain jo Musa ke bhai they) Bani-Israeel ki aadat thi (jaisey ab sab ki aadat hai) ke wo paighambaron aur agley nekon ke naam par naam rakhtey they."
"5648","Motamir bin Sulaiman ne kaha : maine rukban se suna, wo apne walid se hadis bayan kar rahe they, unhon-ne Hazrat Samra-bin-Jundub (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein apne ghulaamon ke ye char naam rakhney se mana farmaya : Aflah ( zyada kaamyaab), Ribah (munaafe wala) , Yasar ( aasani wala (aur Naafe (nafa pahunchane-wala ( ."
"5649","Motamir bin Sulaiman ne kaha : maine rukban se suna, wo apne walid se hadis bayan kar rahe they, unhon-ne Hazrat Samra-bin-Jundub (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein apne ghulaamon ke ye char naam rakhney se mana farmaya : Aflah ( zyada kaamyaab), Ribah (munaafe wala) , Yasar ( aasani wala (aur Naafe (nafa pahunchane-wala ( ."
"5650","Jarir ne Rukein bin Rabe se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Samra-bin-Jundub (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : apne ladkey (ghulam, khaadim) ka naam ribaah, Yasar, Aflah, aur Naafe na rakho."
"5651","Jarir ne Rukein bin Rabe se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Samra-bin-Jundub (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : apne ladkey (ghulam, khaadim) ka naam ribaah, Yasar, Aflah, aur Naafe na rakho."
"5652","Mina saiyedna Samra-bin-Jundub (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''sabse zyada pasand Allah Taala ko char kalimey hain ( سُبْحَانَ اللهِ , وَالْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ , وَلاَ إِلَهَ إِلاَّ اللَّهُ , وَاللَّهُ أَكْبَرُ ( inmein se jis ko chahey pahley kahey koi nuqsan na hoga aur apne ghulam ka naam Yasar, Ribah aur Najeeh (iske wahi mana hain jo Aflah ke hain) aur Aflah na rakho. isliye ke to poochhega wahan wo hai (yani Yasar ya Ribah ya najeeh ya Aflah ( wo kahega nahi hai.'' Samra ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yahi char naam farmaai . to zyada mat naql karna mujh se."
"5653","Mina saiyedna Samra-bin-Jundub (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''sabse zyada pasand Allah Taala ko char kalimey hain ( سُبْحَانَ اللهِ , وَالْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ , وَلاَ إِلَهَ إِلاَّ اللَّهُ , وَاللَّهُ أَكْبَرُ ( inmein se jis ko chahey pahley kahey koi nuqsan na hoga aur apne ghulam ka naam Yasar, Ribah aur Najeeh (iske wahi mana hain jo Aflah ke hain) aur Aflah na rakho. isliye ke to poochhega wahan wo hai (yani Yasar ya Ribah ya najeeh ya Aflah ( wo kahega nahi hai.'' Samra ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yahi char naam farmaai . to zyada mat naql karna mujh se."
"5654","Jareer, Rooh bin-Qasim aur Shoba sab ne Mansoor se Zuhair ki sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, Jarir aur Rooh ki hadis qissey samet Zuhair ki hadis jaisi hai. aur jo Shoba ki hadis hai. usmein sirf ghulam ka naam rakhney ka zikr hai, unhon-ne char behtreen kalimaat ka zikr nahi kya."
"5655","Jareer, Rooh bin-Qasim aur Shoba sab ne Mansoor se Zuhair ki sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, Jarir aur Rooh ki hadis qissey samet Zuhair ki hadis jaisi hai. aur jo Shoba ki hadis hai. usmein sirf ghulam ka naam rakhney ka zikr hai, unhon-ne char behtreen kalimaat ka zikr nahi kya."
"5656","ibne-Juraij ne kaha : mujhey abu-Zubair ne bataya ke unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne irada farmaya ke aap Yala ( buland ( , barkat , Aflah , Yasar Naafe jaisey naam rakhney se mana farma dein, phir maine dekha ke aap khamosh ho gaey, phir aap ki rihlat hui to aap ne un naamon se nahi roka tha, phir Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse rokney ka irada kya to unhon-ne bhi (ye irada) tark kar diya."
"5657","ibne-Juraij ne kaha : mujhey abu-Zubair ne bataya ke unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne irada farmaya ke aap Yala ( buland ( , barkat , Aflah , Yasar Naafe jaisey naam rakhney se mana farma dein, phir maine dekha ke aap khamosh ho gaey, phir aap ki rihlat hui to aap ne un naamon se nahi roka tha, phir Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse rokney ka irada kya to unhon-ne bhi (ye irada) tark kar diya."
"5658","Ahmad-bin-Hanbal, Zuhair-bin-Harab, Muhammad-bin-Musanna, Ubaidullah bin Saeed aur Muhammad-bin Bishr ne (un sab ne) kaha : hamein Yahya-bin-Saeed ne Ubaidullah se hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey Naafe ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aasiya (nafarmani karne wali) ka naam tabdeel kar diya aur farmaya : tum jameela ( khoobsurat) ho. Ahmed ne mujhey khabar di ki jagah se riwayat hai, kaha hai."
"5659","Ahmad-bin-Hanbal, Zuhair-bin-Harab, Muhammad-bin-Musanna, Ubaidullah bin Saeed aur Muhammad-bin Bishr ne (un sab ne) kaha : hamein Yahya-bin-Saeed ne Ubaidullah se hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey Naafe ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aasiya (nafarmani karne wali) ka naam tabdeel kar diya aur farmaya : tum jameela ( khoobsurat) ho. Ahmed ne mujhey khabar di ki jagah se riwayat hai, kaha hai."
"5660","Hammaad-bin-Salma ne Ubaidullah se, unhon-ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ki aik sahibzadi ko aasiya kaha jata tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uska naam jameela rakh diya."
"5661","Hammaad-bin-Salma ne Ubaidullah se, unhon-ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ki aik sahibzadi ko aasiya kaha jata tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uska naam jameela rakh diya."
"5662","Amr Naqid aur ibne-abi-Umar ne hadis bayan ki. alfaz Amr ke hain. donon ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan ne aale-Talha ke aazad karda ghulam Muhammad-bin-Abdur-Rehman se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Kureb se, unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : (pahley Ummul-Momenin Hazrat ( Juweriya (Raziallahu anhu) ka naam barra tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka naam badal kar Juweriya rakh diya. aapko pasand na tha. ke is tarah kaha jaey ke aap barra (nekiyon wali) ke yahan se nikal gaey. ibne-abi-Umar ki hadis mein hai : Kureb se riwayat hai, kaha : maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna."
"5663","Amr Naqid aur ibne-abi-Umar ne hadis bayan ki. alfaz Amr ke hain. donon ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan ne aale-Talha ke aazad karda ghulam Muhammad-bin-Abdur-Rehman se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Kureb se, unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : (pahley Ummul-Momenin Hazrat ( Juweriya (Raziallahu anhu) ka naam barra tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka naam badal kar Juweriya rakh diya. aapko pasand na tha. ke is tarah kaha jaey ke aap barra (nekiyon wali) ke yahan se nikal gaey. ibne-abi-Umar ki hadis mein hai : Kureb se riwayat hai, kaha : maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna."
"5664","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba , Muhammad-bin-Musanna aur Muhammad-bin-Bashar ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hadis bayan ki, Muhammad-bin-Jafar aur Ubaidullah ke walid Muaz ne Shoba se, unhon-ne Ataa-bin-abi-Memoona se, unhon-ne abu Raafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Zenab (binte-Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) (ka naam barra tha to kaha gaya ke wo (naam batatey waqt khud) apni parsaai bayan karti hain, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka naam Zenab rakh diya. hadis ke alfaz ibne-Bashar ke ilawa baqi sab ke (bayan kiya hua) hain. ibne-Abi-Sheba ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne Shoba se hadis bayan ki."
"5665","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba , Muhammad-bin-Musanna aur Muhammad-bin-Bashar ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hadis bayan ki, Muhammad-bin-Jafar aur Ubaidullah ke walid Muaz ne Shoba se, unhon-ne Ataa-bin-abi-Memoona se, unhon-ne abu Raafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Zenab (binte-Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) (ka naam barra tha to kaha gaya ke wo (naam batatey waqt khud) apni parsaai bayan karti hain, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka naam Zenab rakh diya. hadis ke alfaz ibne-Bashar ke ilawa baqi sab ke (bayan kiya hua) hain. ibne-Abi-Sheba ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne Shoba se hadis bayan ki."
"5666","Waleed-bin-Kasir ne kaha : mujhey Muhammad-bin-Amr-bin-Ata ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey Hazrat Zenab binte- Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ne bataya , kaha : mera naam barra tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mera naam Zenab rakh diya. unhon-ne kaha : jab Zenab binte-Jahash (Raziallahu anha) aap ke hibaala nikah mein dakhil huin to unka naam bhi barra tha, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka naam bhi Zenab rakha."
"5667","Waleed-bin-Kasir ne kaha : mujhey Muhammad-bin-Amr-bin-Ata ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey Hazrat Zenab binte- Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ne bataya , kaha : mera naam barra tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mera naam Zenab rakh diya. unhon-ne kaha : jab Zenab binte-Jahash (Raziallahu anha) aap ke hibaala nikah mein dakhil huin to unka naam bhi barra tha, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka naam bhi Zenab rakha."
"5668","Yazeed-bin-abi-Habib ne Muhammad-bin-Amr-bin-Ata se riwayat ki, kaha : maine apni beti ka naam barra rakha to Hazrat Zenab binte-abi Salma (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujh se kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye naam rakhney se mana farmaya hai. aur (bataya ke) mera naam bhi pahley barra rakha gaya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum log apni paarsaai na bayan karo Allah Taala hi khub janta hai ke tum mein se neku-kaar kon hai? ( ghar ke) logon ne kaha : phir ham iska kiya naam rakhein ? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : iska naam Zenab rakh do."
"5669","Yazeed-bin-abi-Habib ne Muhammad-bin-Amr-bin-Ata se riwayat ki, kaha : maine apni beti ka naam barra rakha to Hazrat Zenab binte-abi Salma (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujh se kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye naam rakhney se mana farmaya hai. aur (bataya ke) mera naam bhi pahley barra rakha gaya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum log apni paarsaai na bayan karo Allah Taala hi khub janta hai ke tum mein se neku-kaar kon hai? ( ghar ke) logon ne kaha : phir ham iska kiya naam rakhein ? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : iska naam Zenab rakh do."
"5670","Saeed-bin-Amr-ash-ashi,  Ahmad-bin-Hanbal (Rehmatullahi-alaih) aur abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba ne hamein hadis bayan ki. alfaz imam Ahmed ke hain, ash-ashi ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne khabar di jabke doosrey ne kaha : hamein hadis bayan ki. abu-Zinad se, unhon-ne Aaraj se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala ke nazdeek sabse zaleel samjha jane wala naam us shakhs ka hai jo shahanshaah kahlaaey aur ibne-Abi-Sheba ne apni riwayat mein izafa kiya : izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ke siwa koi ( badhshahat ka ( Malik nahi hai. ash-ashi ka qaul hai : Sufiyan ne kaha : jaisey ( shahanshaah ( hai. aur Ahmad-bin-Hanbal ne kaha : maine abu Amr ( Ishaq-bin-muraar Shebani , nahwi , koofi) se akhna' ke barey mein puchha to unhon-ne kaha : (iske mana hain) auza' (intihai haqeer)."
"5671","Saeed-bin-Amr-ash-ashi,  Ahmad-bin-Hanbal (Rehmatullahi-alaih) aur abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba ne hamein hadis bayan ki. alfaz imam Ahmed ke hain, ash-ashi ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne khabar di jabke doosrey ne kaha : hamein hadis bayan ki. abu-Zinad se, unhon-ne Aaraj se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala ke nazdeek sabse zaleel samjha jane wala naam us shakhs ka hai jo shahanshaah kahlaaey aur ibne-Abi-Sheba ne apni riwayat mein izafa kiya : izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ke siwa koi ( badhshahat ka ( Malik nahi hai. ash-ashi ka qaul hai : Sufiyan ne kaha : jaisey ( shahanshaah ( hai. aur Ahmad-bin-Hanbal ne kaha : maine abu Amr ( Ishaq-bin-muraar Shebani , nahwi , koofi) se akhna' ke barey mein puchha to unhon-ne kaha : (iske mana hain) auza' (intihai haqeer)."
"5672","hamein Mamar ne Hammam-bin-Munabba se khabar di, kaha : ye hadisein hamein Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat kin, phir unhon-ne kuchh hadisein bayan kin, unmein se ye hadis ( bhi) hai : aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala ke nazdeek qiyamat ke din sabse zyada gandaa aur ghazab ka mustahiq shakhs wo hoga jo shahnshaah kahlata hoga, Allah ke siwa koi aur badshah nahi hai."
"5673","hamein Mamar ne Hammam-bin-Munabba se khabar di, kaha : ye hadisein hamein Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat kin, phir unhon-ne kuchh hadisein bayan kin, unmein se ye hadis ( bhi) hai : aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala ke nazdeek qiyamat ke din sabse zyada gandaa aur ghazab ka mustahiq shakhs wo hoga jo shahnshaah kahlata hoga, Allah ke siwa koi aur badshah nahi hai."
"5674","Sabit Bunani ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : jab Abdullah-bin-Ubai Talha (Raziallahu anhu) paida huey to main unhein lekar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, us waqt Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik dhaarii daar abaa (chadar) pahney apne aik oont ko) khaarish se nijat dilaane ke liye) gandhak (ya taarkol) laga rahe they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kuchh khajoor sath hai? maine kaha : ji haan , phir maine aapko kuchh khajoorein pesh kin, aap ne unko apne munh mein daala , unhein chabaya , phir bachchey ka munh khol kar unko apne munh mubarak se seedhey-seedhey uske munh mein daal diya. bachchey ne zaban hilaa kar uska zaayqa lena shuru kar diya. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ye Ansar ki khajooron se mohabbat hai. aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uska naam Abdullah rakha."
"5675","Sabit Bunani ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : jab Abdullah-bin-Ubai Talha (Raziallahu anhu) paida huey to main unhein lekar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, us waqt Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik dhaarii daar abaa (chadar) pahney apne aik oont ko) khaarish se nijat dilaane ke liye) gandhak (ya taarkol) laga rahe they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kuchh khajoor sath hai? maine kaha : ji haan , phir maine aapko kuchh khajoorein pesh kin, aap ne unko apne munh mein daala , unhein chabaya , phir bachchey ka munh khol kar unko apne munh mubarak se seedhey-seedhey uske munh mein daal diya. bachchey ne zaban hilaa kar uska zaayqa lena shuru kar diya. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ye Ansar ki khajooron se mohabbat hai. aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uska naam Abdullah rakha."
"5676","Yazid-bin-Harun ne kaha : hamein Ibne-Aun ne Ibne-Sirin se khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : saiyedna Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain ke abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ka aik ladka bimar tha, wo bahar gaey huey they ke wo ladka faut ho gaya. jab wo lot kar aaey to unhon-ne puchha ke mera bachcha kaisa hai? (unki biwi ( Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ab pahley ki nisbat usko aaraam hai (ye maut ki taraf ishara hai aur kuchh jhoot bhi nahi) . phir Umme-Sulaim Sham ka khana unke paas laaein to unhon-ne khaaya. iske baad Umme-Sulaim se sohbat ki. jab farigh huey to Umme-Sulaim ne kaha ke jao bachche ko dafn kar do. phir subah ko abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sab haal bayan kiya, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha ke kya tum ne raat ko apni biwi se sohbat ki thi? abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ji haan. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua ki ke aey Allah in donon ko barkat de. phir Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan ladka paida hua to abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujh se kaha ke us bachchey ko utha kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas ley ja aur Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ne bachchey ke sath thodi khajoorein bhi bhejin. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us bachchey ko ley liya aur puchha ke iske sath kuchh hai? logon ne kaha ke khajoorein hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khajooron ko lekar chabaya, phir apne munh se nikal kar bachchey ke munh mein daal kar usey ghutthi di aur iska naam Abdullah rakha."
"5677","Yazid-bin-Harun ne kaha : hamein Ibne-Aun ne Ibne-Sirin se khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : saiyedna Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain ke abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ka aik ladka bimar tha, wo bahar gaey huey they ke wo ladka faut ho gaya. jab wo lot kar aaey to unhon-ne puchha ke mera bachcha kaisa hai? (unki biwi ( Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ab pahley ki nisbat usko aaraam hai (ye maut ki taraf ishara hai aur kuchh jhoot bhi nahi) . phir Umme-Sulaim Sham ka khana unke paas laaein to unhon-ne khaaya. iske baad Umme-Sulaim se sohbat ki. jab farigh huey to Umme-Sulaim ne kaha ke jao bachche ko dafn kar do. phir subah ko abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sab haal bayan kiya, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha ke kya tum ne raat ko apni biwi se sohbat ki thi? abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ji haan. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua ki ke aey Allah in donon ko barkat de. phir Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan ladka paida hua to abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujh se kaha ke us bachchey ko utha kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas ley ja aur Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ne bachchey ke sath thodi khajoorein bhi bhejin. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us bachchey ko ley liya aur puchha ke iske sath kuchh hai? logon ne kaha ke khajoorein hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khajooron ko lekar chabaya, phir apne munh se nikal kar bachchey ke munh mein daal kar usey ghutthi di aur iska naam Abdullah rakha."
"5678","Hammad-bin-Mas-ada ne kaha : hamein Ibne-Aun ne Muhammad ( Ibne-Sirin ( se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se usi qissey ke sath Yazeed ki hadis ki tarah bayan kiya."
"5679","Hammad-bin-Mas-ada ne kaha : hamein Ibne-Aun ne Muhammad ( Ibne-Sirin ( se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se usi qissey ke sath Yazeed ki hadis ki tarah bayan kiya."
"5680","Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, kaha : mere yahan aik ladka paida hua, mein usko lekar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, aap ne iska naam Ibrahim rakha aur usko aik khajoor (ke daney) se ghutti di."
"5681","Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, kaha : mere yahan aik ladka paida hua, mein usko lekar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, aap ne iska naam Ibrahim rakha aur usko aik khajoor (ke daney) se ghutti di."
"5682","Shuaib-bin-Ishaq ne kaha : mujhey Hisham-bin-Urwa ne bataya , kaha : mujhey Urwa-bin-Zubair aur Fatima-binte-munzir-bin-Zubair ne hadis bayan ki, donon ne kaha : ke Sayeda Asma (Raziallahu anha) (Makka se) hijrat ki niyat se jis waqt niklin , unke pet mein Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) they (yani haamla thin) jab wo Quba mein aa kar utrein to wahan saiyedna Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) paida huey. phir wilaadat ke baad unhein lekar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaein taake Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usko ghutti lagaaein, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein Sayeda Asma (Raziallahu anha) se ley liya aur apni god mein bithaya , phir aik khajoor mangwaai. Ummul-Momenin Aaisha Siddiqa (Raziallahu anha) kehti hain ke ham aik ghadi tak khajoor dhoondtey rahe, aakhir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khajoor ko chabaayaa, phir (iska joos) unke munh mein daal diya. yahi pehli cheez jo Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ke pet mein pahunchi , wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka thook tha. Sayeda Asma (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke uske baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) par hath phera aur unke liye dua ki aur unka naam Abdullah rakha. phir jab wo saat (7) ya aath (8) baras ke huey to saiyedna Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ke ishaarey par wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bait ke liye aaey. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unko aatey dekha to tabassum farmaya, phir unse (barkat ke liye) bait ki (kyonke wo kam-sin they)."
"5683","Shuaib-bin-Ishaq ne kaha : mujhey Hisham-bin-Urwa ne bataya , kaha : mujhey Urwa-bin-Zubair aur Fatima-binte-munzir-bin-Zubair ne hadis bayan ki, donon ne kaha : ke Sayeda Asma (Raziallahu anha) (Makka se) hijrat ki niyat se jis waqt niklin , unke pet mein Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) they (yani haamla thin) jab wo Quba mein aa kar utrein to wahan saiyedna Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) paida huey. phir wilaadat ke baad unhein lekar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaein taake Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usko ghutti lagaaein, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein Sayeda Asma (Raziallahu anha) se ley liya aur apni god mein bithaya , phir aik khajoor mangwaai. Ummul-Momenin Aaisha Siddiqa (Raziallahu anha) kehti hain ke ham aik ghadi tak khajoor dhoondtey rahe, aakhir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khajoor ko chabaayaa, phir (iska joos) unke munh mein daal diya. yahi pehli cheez jo Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ke pet mein pahunchi , wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka thook tha. Sayeda Asma (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke uske baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) par hath phera aur unke liye dua ki aur unka naam Abdullah rakha. phir jab wo saat (7) ya aath (8) baras ke huey to saiyedna Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ke ishaarey par wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bait ke liye aaey. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unko aatey dekha to tabassum farmaya, phir unse (barkat ke liye) bait ki (kyonke wo kam-sin they)."
"5684","abu-Usama ne Hisham se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Asma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke wo Makka mein haamla huin, Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) unke pet mein they, Hazrat Asma (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke jab main (Makka se) nikli to main poorey dinon se thi, phir main Madina aai aur Quba mein thahri aur Quba mein maine usey ( Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu)) ko janm diya. phir main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui to aap ne usey apni god mein ley liya, phir aap ne khajoor mangwaai , usey chabaayaa . phir apna luaab dahan iske munh mein daal diya, pehli cheez jo iske pet mein gaee wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka lua'ab dahan tha. phir aap ne ( chabaai hui ( khajoor ki ghutti iske taaloo ko lagai, phir uske liye dua ki, barkat mangi , ( hijrat Madina ke baad) ye pahlaa bachcha tha jo Islam mein paida hua."
"5685","abu-Usama ne Hisham se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Asma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke wo Makka mein haamla huin, Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) unke pet mein they, Hazrat Asma (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke jab main (Makka se) nikli to main poorey dinon se thi, phir main Madina aai aur Quba mein thahri aur Quba mein maine usey ( Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu)) ko janm diya. phir main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui to aap ne usey apni god mein ley liya, phir aap ne khajoor mangwaai , usey chabaayaa . phir apna luaab dahan iske munh mein daal diya, pehli cheez jo iske pet mein gaee wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka lua'ab dahan tha. phir aap ne ( chabaai hui ( khajoor ki ghutti iske taaloo ko lagai, phir uske liye dua ki, barkat mangi , ( hijrat Madina ke baad) ye pahlaa bachcha tha jo Islam mein paida hua."
"5686","Ali-bin-Mus'hir ne Hisham-bin-Urwa se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Asma binte-abi-Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf hijrat ki, us waqt wo Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) se haamla thin, phir abu-Usama ki hadis ki tarah bayan kiya."
"5687","Ali-bin-Mus'hir ne Hisham-bin-Urwa se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Asma binte-abi-Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf hijrat ki, us waqt wo Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) se haamla thin, phir abu-Usama ki hadis ki tarah bayan kiya."
"5688","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas bachchey laey jatey, aap unke liye barkat ki dua kartey aur unhein ghutti detey."
"5689","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas bachchey laey jatey, aap unke liye barkat ki dua kartey aur unhein ghutti detey."
"5690","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, kaha : ham ghutti dilwaaney ke liye Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein le gaey, ham ne khajoor hasil karni chahi to hamarey liye uska husool dushwar ho gaya."
"5691","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, kaha : ham ghutti dilwaaney ke liye Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein le gaey, ham ne khajoor hasil karni chahi to hamarey liye uska husool dushwar ho gaya."
"5692","Hazrat Sahal-bin-Sad (bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat hai, kaha : ke abu-Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) ka beta munzir , jab paida hua to usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas laya gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usko apni raan par rakha aur (iske walid ( abu-Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) baithey they phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kisi cheez mein apne samney mutwajjeh huey to abu-Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) ne hukm diya to wo bachcha Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki raan par se utha liya gaya. jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khayal aaya to farmaya ke bachcha kahan hai? saiyedna abu-Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! ham ne usko utha liya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke uska naam kya hai? abu-Usaid ne kaha ke falan naam hai, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi, uska naam munzir hai. phir us din se unhon-ne iska naam munzir hi rakh diya."
"5693","Hazrat Sahal-bin-Sad (bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat hai, kaha : ke abu-Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) ka beta munzir , jab paida hua to usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas laya gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usko apni raan par rakha aur (iske walid ( abu-Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) baithey they phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kisi cheez mein apne samney mutwajjeh huey to abu-Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) ne hukm diya to wo bachcha Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki raan par se utha liya gaya. jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khayal aaya to farmaya ke bachcha kahan hai? saiyedna abu-Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! ham ne usko utha liya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke uska naam kya hai? abu-Usaid ne kaha ke falan naam hai, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi, uska naam munzir hai. phir us din se unhon-ne iska naam munzir hi rakh diya."
"5694","Abu-Tayyah ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tamam insanon se badh kar khush akhalaq they, mera aik bhai tha jisey abu-Umair kaha jata tha. (abu-Tayyaah ne) kaha : mera khayal hai) Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha tha : uska doodh chhudaya ja chuka tha, kaha : jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif latey aur usey dekhtey to farmatey : abu-Umair ! ( nughair ( ne kya kiya? wo bachcha us (parindey) se khelaa karta tha."
"5695","Abu-Tayyah ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tamam insanon se badh kar khush akhalaq they, mera aik bhai tha jisey abu-Umair kaha jata tha. (abu-Tayyaah ne) kaha : mera khayal hai) Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha tha : uska doodh chhudaya ja chuka tha, kaha : jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif latey aur usey dekhtey to farmatey : abu-Umair ! ( nughair ( ne kya kiya? wo bachcha us (parindey) se khelaa karta tha."
"5696","Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya : aey mere betey !"
"5697","Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya : aey mere betey !"
"5698","Yazid-bin-Harun ne Ismail-bin-abi-Khalid se, unhon-ne Qais-bin-abi-Hazim se, unhon-ne Hazrat Mughira-bin-Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se dajjal ke mutaalliq jitney sawalat maine kiye utney kisi aur ne nahi kiye, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya : mere betey ! tumhen us ( dajjal ( se kya baat pareshan kar rahi hai? tumhen us se hargiz koi nuqsan na pahunchega. kaha : maine kaha : log samajhtey hain ke uske sath pani ki nehrein aur roti ke pahaad hongey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : wo Allah Taala ke nazdeek uski nisbat zyada zaleel hai."
"5699","Yazid-bin-Harun ne Ismail-bin-abi-Khalid se, unhon-ne Qais-bin-abi-Hazim se, unhon-ne Hazrat Mughira-bin-Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se dajjal ke mutaalliq jitney sawalat maine kiye utney kisi aur ne nahi kiye, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya : mere betey ! tumhen us ( dajjal ( se kya baat pareshan kar rahi hai? tumhen us se hargiz koi nuqsan na pahunchega. kaha : maine kaha : log samajhtey hain ke uske sath pani ki nehrein aur roti ke pahaad hongey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : wo Allah Taala ke nazdeek uski nisbat zyada zaleel hai."
"5700","Wakee , Hushaim , Jarir aur abu-Usama sab ne Ismail se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, unmein se tanha Yazeed ki hadis mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf se Mughira (Raziallahu anhu) ke liye aey mere betey ke alfaz hain aur kisi ki hadis mein nahi hain."
"5701","Wakee , Hushaim , Jarir aur abu-Usama sab ne Ismail se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, unmein se tanha Yazeed ki hadis mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf se Mughira (Raziallahu anhu) ke liye aey mere betey ke alfaz hain aur kisi ki hadis mein nahi hain."
"5702","Amr-bin-Muhammad-bin Bukair Naqid ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : Allah ki qism ! hamein Yazeed-bin-khaseefa ne Basar-bin-Saeed se hadis bayan ki, kaha : maine Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ko kehtey huey suna : main Madina Munawra mein Ansar ki majlis mein betha hua tha itney mein abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) darey sahmey huey aaey, ham ne unse puchha aapko kya hua? unhon-ne bataya ke Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne meri taraf paigham bheja hai ke main unke paas aaoon. main unke darwazey par gaya aur teen martaba salam kiya unhon-ne mujhey salam ka jawab nahi diya to main lot aaya, unhon-ne kaha : aapko hamarey paas aaney se kis baat ne rokaa? maine kaha : main aaya tha, aap ke darwazey par khadey teen baar salam kiya, aap logon ne mujhey jawab nahi diya, isliye main lot gaya kyonke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha : jab tum mein se koi shakhs teen baar ijazat maangey aur usey ijazat na di jaey to wo lot jaey. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya : is par gawahi pesh karo warna main tum ko saza doonga. Hazrat Ubai-ibne-Ka'b (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : unke sath sirf wo shakhs ja kar khada hoga jo qaum mein se sabse kam Umr hai, Hazrat abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine kaha ke main sabse kam Umr hun to unhon-ne kaha : tum unke sath jao (aur gawahi do)."
"5703","Amr-bin-Muhammad-bin Bukair Naqid ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : Allah ki qism ! hamein Yazeed-bin-khaseefa ne Basar-bin-Saeed se hadis bayan ki, kaha : maine Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ko kehtey huey suna : main Madina Munawra mein Ansar ki majlis mein betha hua tha itney mein abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) darey sahmey huey aaey, ham ne unse puchha aapko kya hua? unhon-ne bataya ke Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne meri taraf paigham bheja hai ke main unke paas aaoon. main unke darwazey par gaya aur teen martaba salam kiya unhon-ne mujhey salam ka jawab nahi diya to main lot aaya, unhon-ne kaha : aapko hamarey paas aaney se kis baat ne rokaa? maine kaha : main aaya tha, aap ke darwazey par khadey teen baar salam kiya, aap logon ne mujhey jawab nahi diya, isliye main lot gaya kyonke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha : jab tum mein se koi shakhs teen baar ijazat maangey aur usey ijazat na di jaey to wo lot jaey. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya : is par gawahi pesh karo warna main tum ko saza doonga. Hazrat Ubai-ibne-Ka'b (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : unke sath sirf wo shakhs ja kar khada hoga jo qaum mein se sabse kam Umr hai, Hazrat abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine kaha ke main sabse kam Umr hun to unhon-ne kaha : tum unke sath jao (aur gawahi do)."
"5704","Qutaiba-bin-Saeed aur ibne-abi-Umar ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan ne Yazeed-bin-khaseefa se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur ibne-abi-Umar ne apni hadis mein ye izafa kiya : Hazrat abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main unke sath uth khada hua, Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaya aur gawahi di."
"5705","Qutaiba-bin-Saeed aur ibne-abi-Umar ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan ne Yazeed-bin-khaseefa se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur ibne-abi-Umar ne apni hadis mein ye izafa kiya : Hazrat abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main unke sath uth khada hua, Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaya aur gawahi di."
"5706","Bukair-bin-Ashajj se riwayat hai ke Basar-bin-Saeed ne unhein hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, keh rahe they : aik majlis mein ham Hazrat Ubai-ibne-Ka'b (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas baithey huey they. itney mein Hazrat abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ghussey ki haalat mein aaey aur khadey ho gaey phir kehney lagey : main tum ko Allah ki qism deta hun ke tum mein se kisi shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : ijazat teen baar mangi jati hai, agar tumhen ijazat mil jaey (to andar aa jaao), nahi to lot jao? Hazrat abi ne kaha mamla kya hai? unhon-ne kaha : maine kal Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas teen baar ijazat mangi, mujhey ijazat nahi di gaee to main lot gaya phir main aaj unke paas aaya to unke paas hazir ho gaya. maine unhein bataya ke main kal aaya tha, teen baar salam kya tha, phir chala gaya tha. kehney lagey ham ne sun liya tha, us waqt ham kisi kaam mein lagey huey they tum kyon na ijazat maangtey rahe yahan tak ke tumhen ijazat mil jati. maine kaha : maine isi tarah ijazat mangi jis tarah maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna tha. kehney lagey : Allah ki qism ! main tumhari pusht aur peeth par kode maarunga phir tum koi aisa shakhs ley aao jo tumharey liye is par gawahi de. Hazrat Ubai-ibne-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) kehney lagey : Allah ki qism ! tumharey sath ham mein se sirf wo khada hoga jo umr mein sabse chhota hai (badey to badey hain ye hadis ham mein se kam Umr logon ne bhi suni hai aur yad rakhi hai.) abu-Saeed ! utho, (unhon-ne kaha) to main utha , Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaya aur kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko is tarah farmatey huey suna tha."
"5707","Bukair-bin-Ashajj se riwayat hai ke Basar-bin-Saeed ne unhein hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, keh rahe they : aik majlis mein ham Hazrat Ubai-ibne-Ka'b (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas baithey huey they. itney mein Hazrat abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ghussey ki haalat mein aaey aur khadey ho gaey phir kehney lagey : main tum ko Allah ki qism deta hun ke tum mein se kisi shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : ijazat teen baar mangi jati hai, agar tumhen ijazat mil jaey (to andar aa jaao), nahi to lot jao? Hazrat abi ne kaha mamla kya hai? unhon-ne kaha : maine kal Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas teen baar ijazat mangi, mujhey ijazat nahi di gaee to main lot gaya phir main aaj unke paas aaya to unke paas hazir ho gaya. maine unhein bataya ke main kal aaya tha, teen baar salam kya tha, phir chala gaya tha. kehney lagey ham ne sun liya tha, us waqt ham kisi kaam mein lagey huey they tum kyon na ijazat maangtey rahe yahan tak ke tumhen ijazat mil jati. maine kaha : maine isi tarah ijazat mangi jis tarah maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna tha. kehney lagey : Allah ki qism ! main tumhari pusht aur peeth par kode maarunga phir tum koi aisa shakhs ley aao jo tumharey liye is par gawahi de. Hazrat Ubai-ibne-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) kehney lagey : Allah ki qism ! tumharey sath ham mein se sirf wo khada hoga jo umr mein sabse chhota hai (badey to badey hain ye hadis ham mein se kam Umr logon ne bhi suni hai aur yad rakhi hai.) abu-Saeed ! utho, (unhon-ne kaha) to main utha , Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaya aur kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko is tarah farmatey huey suna tha."
"5708","Bashar-bin-Mufazzal ne kaha : hamein Saeed bin Yazeed ne abu-Nazara se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke darwazey par gaey aur ijazat talab ki, Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ye aik baar hai. phir unhon-ne dobara ijazat talab ki, Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ye dusri baar hai. phir unhon-ne teesri baar ijazat talab ki, Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ye teesri baar hai, phir wo lot gaey. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne ( agley din) kisi ko unke peechhey rawaana kya aur unhein dobara bula bheja. phir (hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne) unse kaha : agar ye aisi baat hai jo tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se (sun kar) yad rakhi hai to theek hai, agar nahi to main tumhen (doosron ke liye nishan) ibrat bana doonga. Hazrat abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : to wo hamarey yahaan aaey aur kehney lagey : tumhen ilm nahi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha : ijazat teen baar talab ki jati hai? kaha : to log hansney lagey, kaha : maine (logon se kaha :) tumharey paas tumhara musalman bhai dara hua aaya hai aur tum hans rahe ho? (phir Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha : ( chalein main us saza mein aap ka hissedaar banunga phir wo Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaey aur kaha : ye abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) hain (ye mere gawah hain.)"
"5709","Bashar-bin-Mufazzal ne kaha : hamein Saeed bin Yazeed ne abu-Nazara se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke darwazey par gaey aur ijazat talab ki, Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ye aik baar hai. phir unhon-ne dobara ijazat talab ki, Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ye dusri baar hai. phir unhon-ne teesri baar ijazat talab ki, Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ye teesri baar hai, phir wo lot gaey. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne ( agley din) kisi ko unke peechhey rawaana kya aur unhein dobara bula bheja. phir (hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne) unse kaha : agar ye aisi baat hai jo tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se (sun kar) yad rakhi hai to theek hai, agar nahi to main tumhen (doosron ke liye nishan) ibrat bana doonga. Hazrat abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : to wo hamarey yahaan aaey aur kehney lagey : tumhen ilm nahi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha : ijazat teen baar talab ki jati hai? kaha : to log hansney lagey, kaha : maine (logon se kaha :) tumharey paas tumhara musalman bhai dara hua aaya hai aur tum hans rahe ho? (phir Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha : ( chalein main us saza mein aap ka hissedaar banunga phir wo Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaey aur kaha : ye abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) hain (ye mere gawah hain.)"
"5710","Shoba ne abu-Salma Jurairi aur Saeed bin Yazeed se hadis bayan ki, Jurairi aur Saeed bin Yazeed donon ne abu-Nazara se riwayat ki, donon ne kaha : ham ne unhein Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se usi hadis ke ham mana hadis bayan kartey huey suna, jis tarah Bashar-bin-Mufazzal ne abu-Salma se riwayat ki hai."
"5711","Shoba ne abu-Salma Jurairi aur Saeed bin Yazeed se hadis bayan ki, Jurairi aur Saeed bin Yazeed donon ne abu-Nazara se riwayat ki, donon ne kaha : ham ne unhein Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se usi hadis ke ham mana hadis bayan kartey huey suna, jis tarah Bashar-bin-Mufazzal ne abu-Salma se riwayat ki hai."
"5712","Yahya-bin-Saeed qattaan ne ibne-Juraij se riwayat ki kaha : hamein Ata ne Ubaid-bin-Umair se hadis bayan ki ke Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) se teen martaba ijazat talab ki to jaisey unhon-ne Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko mashghool samjha aur wapas ho gaey. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : kya ham ne Abdullah-bin-Qais ( abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu)) ki awaz nahi suni thi? unko andar aaney ki ijazat do, (Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) wapas chaley gaey huey they, doosrey din) Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ko bulaya gaya Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : tum ne aisa kyon kiya? unhon-ne kaha : hamein yahi ( karne ka ( hukm diya jata tha. unhon-ne kaha : tum is par gawahi dilao , nahi to main (wo ( karunga (jo karunga ( wo (Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu)) nikley Ansar ki majlis mein aaey unhon-ne kaha : is baat par tumharey haq main aur koi nahi, ham mein se jo sabse chhota hai wahi gawahi dega. abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne (Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke samney ( khadey ho kar kaha : hamein ( Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahade-mubaarak mein) usi ka hukm diya jata tha. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ye hukm mujh se ojhal reh gaya, bazaron mein hone-waale sodon ne mujhey us se mashghool kar diya."
"5713","Yahya-bin-Saeed qattaan ne ibne-Juraij se riwayat ki kaha : hamein Ata ne Ubaid-bin-Umair se hadis bayan ki ke Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) se teen martaba ijazat talab ki to jaisey unhon-ne Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko mashghool samjha aur wapas ho gaey. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : kya ham ne Abdullah-bin-Qais ( abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu)) ki awaz nahi suni thi? unko andar aaney ki ijazat do, (Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) wapas chaley gaey huey they, doosrey din) Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ko bulaya gaya Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : tum ne aisa kyon kiya? unhon-ne kaha : hamein yahi ( karne ka ( hukm diya jata tha. unhon-ne kaha : tum is par gawahi dilao , nahi to main (wo ( karunga (jo karunga ( wo (Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu)) nikley Ansar ki majlis mein aaey unhon-ne kaha : is baat par tumharey haq main aur koi nahi, ham mein se jo sabse chhota hai wahi gawahi dega. abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne (Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke samney ( khadey ho kar kaha : hamein ( Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahade-mubaarak mein) usi ka hukm diya jata tha. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ye hukm mujh se ojhal reh gaya, bazaron mein hone-waale sodon ne mujhey us se mashghool kar diya."
"5714","abu-Aasim aur Nazar-bin-Shumail donon ne kaha : hamein ibne-Juraij ne isi sanad ke sath isi tarah hadis bayan ki. aur nazar ki hadis mein unhon-ne bazaron mein hone-waale sodon ne mujhey us se mashghool kar diya ke alfaz bayan nahi kiye."
"5715","abu-Aasim aur Nazar-bin-Shumail donon ne kaha : hamein ibne-Juraij ne isi sanad ke sath isi tarah hadis bayan ki. aur nazar ki hadis mein unhon-ne bazaron mein hone-waale sodon ne mujhey us se mashghool kar diya ke alfaz bayan nahi kiye."
"5716","Fazal bin-Musa ne kaha : hamein Talha bin Yahya ne abu-Burda se khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) Hazrat umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaey aur kaha : Assalaamualaikum , Abdullah-bin-Qais ( hazir hua) hai, unhon-ne aaney ki ijazat na di. unhon-ne phir kaha : Assalaamualaikum , ye abu-Musa hai, Assalaamualaikum , ye Ash-ari hai, iske baad chaley gaey, Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : unko mere paas wapas laao. mere paas wapas laao. wo aaey to Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : abu-Musa ! aapko kis baat ne lota diya ? ham kaam mein mashghool they. unhon-ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap ne farmaya : ijazat teen baar talab ki jaey, agar tum ko ijazat de di jaey (to aa jaao) warna lot jao. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ya to aap is par gawah laaengey ya phir main ye karunga to Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) chaley gaey. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha abu-Musa ko gawah mil gaya to Sham ko wo tumhen member ke paas milengey aur agar unko gawah nahi mila to wo tumhen nahi milengey, jab Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) Sham ko aaey to unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ko maujood paya , unhon-ne kaha abu-Musa ! kya kehtey hain? aapko gawah mil gaya? unhon-ne kaha : haan! Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) hain unhon (hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : wo qaabile-bharosa gawah hain. (phir abu Tufail Aamir bin Wasila (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf mutwajjeh ho kar) kaha : abu Tufail! ye (Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu)) kya kehtey hain? unhon (Hazrat Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : ibne-khattaab ! maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap yahi farma rahe they. lihaza aap Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) par azab na banein. unhon-ne kaha : Subhan-Allah! maine aik cheez suni aur chaha ke uska saboot hasil karun."
"5717","Fazal bin-Musa ne kaha : hamein Talha bin Yahya ne abu-Burda se khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) Hazrat umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaey aur kaha : Assalaamualaikum , Abdullah-bin-Qais ( hazir hua) hai, unhon-ne aaney ki ijazat na di. unhon-ne phir kaha : Assalaamualaikum , ye abu-Musa hai, Assalaamualaikum , ye Ash-ari hai, iske baad chaley gaey, Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : unko mere paas wapas laao. mere paas wapas laao. wo aaey to Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : abu-Musa ! aapko kis baat ne lota diya ? ham kaam mein mashghool they. unhon-ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap ne farmaya : ijazat teen baar talab ki jaey, agar tum ko ijazat de di jaey (to aa jaao) warna lot jao. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ya to aap is par gawah laaengey ya phir main ye karunga to Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) chaley gaey. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha abu-Musa ko gawah mil gaya to Sham ko wo tumhen member ke paas milengey aur agar unko gawah nahi mila to wo tumhen nahi milengey, jab Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) Sham ko aaey to unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ko maujood paya , unhon-ne kaha abu-Musa ! kya kehtey hain? aapko gawah mil gaya? unhon-ne kaha : haan! Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) hain unhon (hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : wo qaabile-bharosa gawah hain. (phir abu Tufail Aamir bin Wasila (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf mutwajjeh ho kar) kaha : abu Tufail! ye (Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu)) kya kehtey hain? unhon (Hazrat Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : ibne-khattaab ! maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap yahi farma rahe they. lihaza aap Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) par azab na banein. unhon-ne kaha : Subhan-Allah! maine aik cheez suni aur chaha ke uska saboot hasil karun."
"5718","Ali-bin Hashim ne Talha bin Yahya se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, magar unhon-ne kaha : to unhon (Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : abu munzir ! ( Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) ki kunniyat ( kya aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye hadis suni thi? unhon-ne kaha : haan, ibne-khattaab! to aap Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) ke liye azab na banein aur unhon-ne Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ka qaul : Subhan-Allah aur uske baad ka hissa zikr nahi kya."
"5719","Ali-bin Hashim ne Talha bin Yahya se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, magar unhon-ne kaha : to unhon (Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : abu munzir ! ( Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) ki kunniyat ( kya aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye hadis suni thi? unhon-ne kaha : haan, ibne-khattaab! to aap Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) ke liye azab na banein aur unhon-ne Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ka qaul : Subhan-Allah aur uske baad ka hissa zikr nahi kya."
"5720","Abdullah-bin-Idris ne Shoba se unhon-ne Muhammad-bin Munkadir se, unhon-ne Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur awaz di Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kon hai? maine kaha : main. aap bahar tashrif laey aur aap farma rahe they َ mein, main ( kaisa jawab hai? ("
"5721","Abdullah-bin-Idris ne Shoba se unhon-ne Muhammad-bin Munkadir se, unhon-ne Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur awaz di Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kon hai? maine kaha : main. aap bahar tashrif laey aur aap farma rahe they َ mein, main ( kaisa jawab hai? ("
"5722","Wakee ne Shoba se, unhon-ne Muhammad-bin Munkadir se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki kaha : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan ijazat talab ki, aap ne farmaya : ye kon hai? maine kaha : main. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mein, main ! (se kya pata chal sakta hai? ("
"5723","Wakee ne Shoba se, unhon-ne Muhammad-bin Munkadir se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki kaha : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan ijazat talab ki, aap ne farmaya : ye kon hai? maine kaha : main. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mein, main ! (se kya pata chal sakta hai? ("
"5724","Nazar-bin-Shumail abu-Aamir aqadi Wahab bin Jarir aur Bahaz, sab ne Shoba se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki, un sab ki hadis mein (ye jumla bhi) hai : jaisey aap ne usko na-pasand farmaya ho."
"5725","Nazar-bin-Shumail abu-Aamir aqadi Wahab bin Jarir aur Bahaz, sab ne Shoba se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki, un sab ki hadis mein (ye jumla bhi) hai : jaisey aap ne usko na-pasand farmaya ho."
"5726","Leis ne ibne-Shahab se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Sahal-bin-Sad Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein bataya ke aik shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke darwazey ki jhiri mein andar jhanka, us waqt Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas (lakdi ya lohe ka lambi lambi kai nokon wala) baal durust karne ka aik aala tha jis se aap sar khujaa rahe they, jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usko dekha to farmaya : agar mujhey yaqeeni taur par pata chal jata ke tum mujhey dekh rahe ho to main usko tumhari aankhon mein ghusa deta, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ijazat leney ka tariqa aankh hi ki wjah se to rakha gaya hai. (ke aankh kisi ko khilwat ke aalim mein na dekh sakey.)"
"5727","Leis ne ibne-Shahab se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Sahal-bin-Sad Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein bataya ke aik shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke darwazey ki jhiri mein andar jhanka, us waqt Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas (lakdi ya lohe ka lambi lambi kai nokon wala) baal durust karne ka aik aala tha jis se aap sar khujaa rahe they, jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usko dekha to farmaya : agar mujhey yaqeeni taur par pata chal jata ke tum mujhey dekh rahe ho to main usko tumhari aankhon mein ghusa deta, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ijazat leney ka tariqa aankh hi ki wjah se to rakha gaya hai. (ke aankh kisi ko khilwat ke aalim mein na dekh sakey.)"
"5728","Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se riwayat ki ke Sahal-bin-Sad Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein bataya ke aik shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke darwazey mein bin janey wali jhiri mein se jhanka, us waqt Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas baal durust karne wala lohey ka aik aala tha jis se aap sar ke baalon ko sanwaar rahe they Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya : agar main jaan leta ke tum waqei mujhey dekh rahe ho to main usko tumhari aankhon mein chubho deta. Allah ne ijazat leney ka tariqa aankh hi ke liye to rakha hai."
"5729","Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se riwayat ki ke Sahal-bin-Sad Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein bataya ke aik shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke darwazey mein bin janey wali jhiri mein se jhanka, us waqt Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas baal durust karne wala lohey ka aik aala tha jis se aap sar ke baalon ko sanwaar rahe they Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya : agar main jaan leta ke tum waqei mujhey dekh rahe ho to main usko tumhari aankhon mein chubho deta. Allah ne ijazat leney ka tariqa aankh hi ke liye to rakha hai."
"5730","Sufiyan-bin-Uena aur Mamar donon ne Zohri se unhon-ne Hazrat Sahal-bin-Sad (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Leis aur Yunus ki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"5731","Sufiyan-bin-Uena aur Mamar donon ne Zohri se unhon-ne Hazrat Sahal-bin-Sad (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Leis aur Yunus ki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"5732","Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hujrey mein jhanka Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chode phal ka aik teer ya kai teer lekar uthey jaisey main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekh raha hun ke aap khamoshi se uski aankhon mein wo teer chubhone ke imkan ka jaaiza ley rahe they."
"5733","Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hujrey mein jhanka Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chode phal ka aik teer ya kai teer lekar uthey jaisey main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekh raha hun ke aap khamoshi se uski aankhon mein wo teer chubhone ke imkan ka jaaiza ley rahe they."
"5734","Suhel ke walid Abu-Saleh ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : jisne ijazat ke baghair logon ke ghar mein taank jhank ki, unhein ijazat hai ke wo uski aankh phod din."
"5735","Suhel ke walid Abu-Saleh ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : jisne ijazat ke baghair logon ke ghar mein taank jhank ki, unhein ijazat hai ke wo uski aankh phod din."
"5736","Aaraj ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : agar koi shakhs ijazat ke baghair tumharey yahaan jhaankey aur tum kankari maarkar uski aankh phod do to tum par koi gunah nahi hai (koi saza ya jurmaana nahi.)"
"5737","Aaraj ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : agar koi shakhs ijazat ke baghair tumharey yahaan jhaankey aur tum kankari maarkar uski aankh phod do to tum par koi gunah nahi hai (koi saza ya jurmaana nahi.)"
"5738","Yazeed bin Zaree, Ismail bin-Ulaih aur Hushaim ne Yunus se, unhon-ne Amr bin Saeed se, unhon-ne Abu-Zaraa se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jareer-bin-Abdullaah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se achcha nazar pad jaane ke barey mein puchha to aap ne mujhey hukm diya ke main apni nazar hata lun."
"5739","Yazeed bin Zaree, Ismail bin-Ulaih aur Hushaim ne Yunus se, unhon-ne Amr bin Saeed se, unhon-ne Abu-Zaraa se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jareer-bin-Abdullaah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se achcha nazar pad jaane ke barey mein puchha to aap ne mujhey hukm diya ke main apni nazar hata lun."
"5740","Abdul-Aala aur Sufiyan donon ne Yunus se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"5741","Abdul-Aala aur Sufiyan donon ne Yunus se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"5742","Abdur-Rehman bin Zaid ke aazad karda ghulam Sabit ne bataya ke unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, keh rahe they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : sawar pedal ko salam karey, chalney wala baithey huey ko salam karey aur kam log zyada logon ko salam karein."
"5743","Abdur-Rehman bin Zaid ke aazad karda ghulam Sabit ne bataya ke unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, keh rahe they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : sawar pedal ko salam karey, chalney wala baithey huey ko salam karey aur kam log zyada logon ko salam karein."
"5744","Ishaq bin-Abdullah-bin abi Talha ne apne walid se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha ke Hazrat abu Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ham makaanon ke samney ki khuli jaghon mein baithey baatein kar rahe they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif ley aaey aur hamarey paas khadey ho gaey. aap ne farmaya : tumhara raston ki khali jaghon par majlison se kya sarokaar ? raston ki majaalis se ijtinab karo. ham ne kaha : ham aisi baton ke liye baithey hain jin mein kisi qism ki koi qabahat nahi, ham aik doosrey se guftgu aur baat cheet ke liye baithey hain, aap ne farmaya : agar nahi (reh saktey) to un ( jaghon (ke haq ada karo (jo ye hain) : nigaahein neechi rakhna, salam ka jawab dena aur achi guftgu karna."
"5745","Ishaq bin-Abdullah-bin abi Talha ne apne walid se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha ke Hazrat abu Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ham makaanon ke samney ki khuli jaghon mein baithey baatein kar rahe they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif ley aaey aur hamarey paas khadey ho gaey. aap ne farmaya : tumhara raston ki khali jaghon par majlison se kya sarokaar ? raston ki majaalis se ijtinab karo. ham ne kaha : ham aisi baton ke liye baithey hain jin mein kisi qism ki koi qabahat nahi, ham aik doosrey se guftgu aur baat cheet ke liye baithey hain, aap ne farmaya : agar nahi (reh saktey) to un ( jaghon (ke haq ada karo (jo ye hain) : nigaahein neechi rakhna, salam ka jawab dena aur achi guftgu karna."
"5746","Hafs-bin-Maisra ne Zaid-bin-Aslam se, unhon-ne Ata-bin-Yasar se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : raston mein baithney se ijtinab karo. sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) ne kaha : aey Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ! hamarey liye ( rastey ki) majlison ke baghair jin main ( baith kar) ham baatein kartey hain, koi chaara nahi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : agar tum majaalis ke baghair nahi reh ho saktey to rastey ka haq ada karo. logon ne kaha : iska haq kya hai? aap ne farmaya : nigaah neechi rakhna takleef deh chizon ko) rastey se) hataana, salam ka jawab dena, achai ki talqeen karna aur burai se rokna."
"5747","Hafs-bin-Maisra ne Zaid-bin-Aslam se, unhon-ne Ata-bin-Yasar se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : raston mein baithney se ijtinab karo. sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) ne kaha : aey Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ! hamarey liye ( rastey ki) majlison ke baghair jin main ( baith kar) ham baatein kartey hain, koi chaara nahi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : agar tum majaalis ke baghair nahi reh ho saktey to rastey ka haq ada karo. logon ne kaha : iska haq kya hai? aap ne farmaya : nigaah neechi rakhna takleef deh chizon ko) rastey se) hataana, salam ka jawab dena, achai ki talqeen karna aur burai se rokna."
"5748","abdul-Azeez-bin Muhammad madni aur Hisham bin Sad donon ne Zaid-bin-Aslam se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki."
"5749","abdul-Azeez-bin Muhammad madni aur Hisham bin Sad donon ne Zaid-bin-Aslam se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki."
"5750","Yunus ne ibne-Shahab (Zohri ( se unhon-ne ibne-Musaiyab se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : musalman ke musalman par paanch haq hain. neez Abdur-Razzaq ne kaha : hamein Mamar ne ( ibne-Shahab ( Zohri se khabar di, unhon-ne ibne-Musaiyab se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aik musalman ke liye uske bhai par panch cheezein wajib hain : salam ka jawab dena, chheenk maarney waley ke liye rehmat ki dua karna, dawat qabool karna, mareez ki iyaadat karna aur janaazon ke sath jana. Abdur-Razzaq ne kaha : Mamar us hadis (ki sanad) mein irsaal kartey they (taabai aur sahabi ka naam zikr nahi kartey they) aur kabhi usey (Saeed (bin Musaiyab aur aagey Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki sanad se (muttasil marfooa) riwayat kartey they."
"5751","Yunus ne ibne-Shahab (Zohri ( se unhon-ne ibne-Musaiyab se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : musalman ke musalman par paanch haq hain. neez Abdur-Razzaq ne kaha : hamein Mamar ne ( ibne-Shahab ( Zohri se khabar di, unhon-ne ibne-Musaiyab se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aik musalman ke liye uske bhai par panch cheezein wajib hain : salam ka jawab dena, chheenk maarney waley ke liye rehmat ki dua karna, dawat qabool karna, mareez ki iyaadat karna aur janaazon ke sath jana. Abdur-Razzaq ne kaha : Mamar us hadis (ki sanad) mein irsaal kartey they (taabai aur sahabi ka naam zikr nahi kartey they) aur kabhi usey (Saeed (bin Musaiyab aur aagey Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki sanad se (muttasil marfooa) riwayat kartey they."
"5752","Ismail-bin-Jafar ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, riwayat ki, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : musalman ke doosrey musalman par chh haq hain. puchha gaya : Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)! wo kon se hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum us se milo to usko salam karo aur jab wo tum ko dawat de to qabool karo aur jab wo tum se nasihat talab karey to usko nasihat karo, aur jab usey chheenk aaey aur alhamdulillah kahey to uske liye rehmat ki dua karo. jab wo bimar ho jaey to uski iyaadat karo aur jab wo faut ho jaey to uske peechhey (janazey mein) jao ."
"5753","Ismail-bin-Jafar ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, riwayat ki, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : musalman ke doosrey musalman par chh haq hain. puchha gaya : Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)! wo kon se hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum us se milo to usko salam karo aur jab wo tum ko dawat de to qabool karo aur jab wo tum se nasihat talab karey to usko nasihat karo, aur jab usey chheenk aaey aur alhamdulillah kahey to uske liye rehmat ki dua karo. jab wo bimar ho jaey to uski iyaadat karo aur jab wo faut ho jaey to uske peechhey (janazey mein) jao ."
"5754","Ubaidullah-bin-abi-Bakr ne apne dada Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat kartey huey khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab ahle-kitab tum ko salam karein to tum unke jawab main (walaikum) (aur tum par) kaho."
"5755","Ubaidullah-bin-abi-Bakr ne apne dada Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat kartey huey khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab ahle-kitab tum ko salam karein to tum unke jawab main (walaikum) (aur tum par) kaho."
"5756","Shoba ne kaha ke maine Qatada se suna, wo Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat kartey huey hadis bayan kar rahe they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha : ahle-kitab hamein salam kartey hain. ham unko kaisey jawab dein, aap ne farmaya : tum log (walaikum) (aur tum par) kaho."
"5757","Shoba ne kaha ke maine Qatada se suna, wo Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat kartey huey hadis bayan kar rahe they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha : ahle-kitab hamein salam kartey hain. ham unko kaisey jawab dein, aap ne farmaya : tum log (walaikum) (aur tum par) kaho."
"5758","Ismail bin Jafar ne Abdullah-bin-Dinar se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, keh rahe they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab yahood tum ko salam kartey hain to unmein se koi shakhs ( اَلسَامُ عَلَيكُم ( (tum par maut nazil ho ( kehta hai. (us par) tum ( عَلَيكَ ( ) tujh par ho ( kaho."
"5759","Ismail bin Jafar ne Abdullah-bin-Dinar se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, keh rahe they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab yahood tum ko salam kartey hain to unmein se koi shakhs ( اَلسَامُ عَلَيكُم ( (tum par maut nazil ho ( kehta hai. (us par) tum ( عَلَيكَ ( ) tujh par ho ( kaho."
"5760","Sufiyan ne Abdullah-bin-Dinar se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iske jaisi riwayat ki magar usmein hai. to tum kaho : ( walaikum ( (tum par ho. ("
"5761","Sufiyan ne Abdullah-bin-Dinar se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iske jaisi riwayat ki magar usmein hai. to tum kaho : ( walaikum ( (tum par ho. ("
"5763","Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne hamein Zohri se hadis bayan ki unhon-ne Urwa se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : yahudiyon ki aik jamat ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se milney ke liye ijazat talab ki aur unhon-ne kaha ( اَلسَامُ عَلَيكُم ( (aap par maut ho ! (Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : balke tum par maut ho aur laanat ho. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Aaisha ! Allah Taala har mamley mein narmi pasand farmata hai. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : kya aap ne suna nahi ke unhon-ne kya kaha tha? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : maine ( وَعَلَيكُم ( (aur tum par ho ( keh diya tha."
"5765","Saleh aur Mamar donon ne Zohri se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, donon ki hadis mein hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : maine ( علیکم ( keh diya tha aur unhon-ne iske sath واؤ (aur ( nahi lagaya ."
"5766","abu-Muawiya ne Aamash se, unhon-ne Muslim se unhon-ne Masruq se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas yahood mein se kuchh log aaey, unhon-ne aa kar kaha : ( السام عليك ya أبا القاسم ) ( abul-Qaasim ! aap par maut ho ( kaha aap ne farmaya : ( وَ عَلَيكُم ( (tum logon par ho!) Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne farmaya : balke tum par maut bhi ho zillat bhi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ! zaban buri na karo. unhon ( Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ( ne kaha : aap ne nahi suna, unhon-ne kya kaha tha? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : unhon-ne jo kaha tha maine unko lota diya, maine kaha : tum par ho."
"5767","abu-Muawiya ne Aamash se, unhon-ne Muslim se unhon-ne Masruq se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas yahood mein se kuchh log aaey, unhon-ne aa kar kaha : ( السام عليك ya أبا القاسم ) ( abul-Qaasim ! aap par maut ho ( kaha aap ne farmaya : ( وَ عَلَيكُم ( (tum logon par ho!) Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne farmaya : balke tum par maut bhi ho zillat bhi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ! zaban buri na karo. unhon ( Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ( ne kaha : aap ne nahi suna, unhon-ne kya kaha tha? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : unhon-ne jo kaha tha maine unko lota diya, maine kaha : tum par ho."
"5768","Yala bin Ubaid ne hamein khabar di, kaha : hamein Aamash ne isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, magar unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne unki baat samajh li (unhon-ne salam ke bajaey saam ka lafz bola tha) aur unhein bura bhala kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Aaisha ! bas karo, Allah Taala burai aur usey apna leney ko pasand nahi farmata aur ye izafa kya to is par izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ne ( وَإِذَا جَاءُوكَ حَيَّوْكَ بِمَا لَمْ يُحَيِّكَ بِهِ اللَّهُ ( nazil farmai : aur jab wo aap ke paas aatey hain to aapko is tarah salam nahi kehtey jis tarah Allah aapko salam kehta hai. aayat ke aakhir tak (aur apne dilon mein kehtey hain jo kuchh ham kehtey hain Allah is par hamein azab kyon nahi deta ? unke liye dozakh kafi hai jis mein wo jalengey aur wo lot kar janey ka badtareen thikana hai.)"
"5769","Yala bin Ubaid ne hamein khabar di, kaha : hamein Aamash ne isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, magar unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne unki baat samajh li (unhon-ne salam ke bajaey saam ka lafz bola tha) aur unhein bura bhala kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Aaisha ! bas karo, Allah Taala burai aur usey apna leney ko pasand nahi farmata aur ye izafa kya to is par izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ne ( وَإِذَا جَاءُوكَ حَيَّوْكَ بِمَا لَمْ يُحَيِّكَ بِهِ اللَّهُ ( nazil farmai : aur jab wo aap ke paas aatey hain to aapko is tarah salam nahi kehtey jis tarah Allah aapko salam kehta hai. aayat ke aakhir tak (aur apne dilon mein kehtey hain jo kuchh ham kehtey hain Allah is par hamein azab kyon nahi deta ? unke liye dozakh kafi hai jis mein wo jalengey aur wo lot kar janey ka badtareen thikana hai.)"
"5770","abu-Zubair ne kaha : unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ko kehtey huey suna : yahood mein se kuchh logon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salam kya aur kaha ( السام عليك ya أبا القاسم ) (abul-Qaasim aap par maut ho !) is par aap ne farmaya : tum par ho. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) kehney lagein aur wo ghussey mein aa gaee thin. kya aap ne nahi suna, jo unhon-ne kaha hai? aap ne farmaya : kyon nahi ! maine suna hai aur maine unko jawab de diya hai aur unke khilaf hamari dua qaboo hoti hai aur hamarey khilaf unki dua qabool nahi hoti ."
"5771","abu-Zubair ne kaha : unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ko kehtey huey suna : yahood mein se kuchh logon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salam kya aur kaha ( السام عليك ya أبا القاسم ) (abul-Qaasim aap par maut ho !) is par aap ne farmaya : tum par ho. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) kehney lagein aur wo ghussey mein aa gaee thin. kya aap ne nahi suna, jo unhon-ne kaha hai? aap ne farmaya : kyon nahi ! maine suna hai aur maine unko jawab de diya hai aur unke khilaf hamari dua qaboo hoti hai aur hamarey khilaf unki dua qabool nahi hoti ."
"5772","Abdul-Azeez darawardi ne Suhel se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : yahood nasara ko salam kehney mein shuruat na karo aur jab tum unmein se kisi ko rastey mein milo (to bajaey iske wo ye kaam karey) tum usey rastey ke tang hissey ki taraf janey par majbur kar do."
"5773","Abdul-Azeez darawardi ne Suhel se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : yahood nasara ko salam kehney mein shuruat na karo aur jab tum unmein se kisi ko rastey mein milo (to bajaey iske wo ye kaam karey) tum usey rastey ke tang hissey ki taraf janey par majbur kar do."
"5774","Muhammad-bin-Musanna ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba ne hadis bayan ki abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba aur abu-Kuraib ne kaha : hamein Wakee ne Sufiyan se hadis bayan ki, Zuhair-bin-Harab ne kaha : hamein Jarir ne hadis bayan ki, un sab (Shoba Sufiyan aur Jareer) ne Suhel se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki. Wakee ki hadis mein hai, jab tum yahood se milo. Shoba se ibne-Jafar ki riwayat ki hui hadis mein hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ahle-kitab ke barey mein farmaya aur Jarir ki riwayat mein hai : jab tum un logon se milo, aur mushrikon mein se kisi aik (giroh) ka naam nahi liya."
"5775","Muhammad-bin-Musanna ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba ne hadis bayan ki abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba aur abu-Kuraib ne kaha : hamein Wakee ne Sufiyan se hadis bayan ki, Zuhair-bin-Harab ne kaha : hamein Jarir ne hadis bayan ki, un sab (Shoba Sufiyan aur Jareer) ne Suhel se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki. Wakee ki hadis mein hai, jab tum yahood se milo. Shoba se ibne-Jafar ki riwayat ki hui hadis mein hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ahle-kitab ke barey mein farmaya aur Jarir ki riwayat mein hai : jab tum un logon se milo, aur mushrikon mein se kisi aik (giroh) ka naam nahi liya."
"5776","Yahya-bin-Yahya ne kaha : hamein Hushaim ne Sayyar se khabar di, unhon-ne Sabit Bunani se, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un ( Ansar (ke ladkon ke paas se guzrey to aap ne unko salam kya."
"5777","Yahya-bin-Yahya ne kaha : hamein Hushaim ne Sayyar se khabar di, unhon-ne Sabit Bunani se, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un ( Ansar (ke ladkon ke paas se guzrey to aap ne unko salam kya."
"5778","Ismail bin Salim ne kaha : hamein Hushaim ne khabar di, kaha : hamein sayyar ne isi sanad ke sath khabar di."
"5779","Ismail bin Salim ne kaha : hamein Hushaim ne khabar di, kaha : hamein sayyar ne isi sanad ke sath khabar di."
"5780","Shoba ne sayyar se riwayat ki, kaha : main Sabit Bunani ke sath ja raha tha wo kuchh bachchon ke paas se guzrey to unhein salam kya, phir Sabit ne ye hadis bayan ki ke wo Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath ja rahe they wo bachchon ke paas se guzrey to unhon-ne unko salam kya aur Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath ja rahe they Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bachchon ke paas se guzrey to unko salam kya."
"5781","Shoba ne sayyar se riwayat ki, kaha : main Sabit Bunani ke sath ja raha tha wo kuchh bachchon ke paas se guzrey to unhein salam kya, phir Sabit ne ye hadis bayan ki ke wo Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath ja rahe they wo bachchon ke paas se guzrey to unhon-ne unko salam kya aur Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath ja rahe they Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bachchon ke paas se guzrey to unko salam kya."
"5782","Abdul-Wahid bin Ziyad ne kaha : hamein Hasan-bin-Ubaidullah ne hadis bayan ki. kaha : hamein Ibrahim bin Suwed ne hadis sunai kaha : maine Abdur-Rehman bin Yazeed se suna, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, keh rahe they Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya : tumharey liye mere paas aaney ki yahi ijazat hai ke hijaab utha diya jaey aur tum mere raaz ki baat sun lo, (ye ijazat us waqt tak hai) yahan tak ke main tumhen rok dun."
"5783","Abdul-Wahid bin Ziyad ne kaha : hamein Hasan-bin-Ubaidullah ne hadis bayan ki. kaha : hamein Ibrahim bin Suwed ne hadis sunai kaha : maine Abdur-Rehman bin Yazeed se suna, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, keh rahe they Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya : tumharey liye mere paas aaney ki yahi ijazat hai ke hijaab utha diya jaey aur tum mere raaz ki baat sun lo, (ye ijazat us waqt tak hai) yahan tak ke main tumhen rok dun."
"5784","Abdullah-bin-Idris ne Hasan-bin- Abdullah se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"5785","Abdullah-bin-Idris ne Hasan-bin- Abdullah se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"5786","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba aur abu-Kuraib ne kaha : hamein abu-Usama ne Hisham se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : parda ham par laagu ho janey ke baad Hazrat Sauda (Raziallahu anha) qazaey-hajat (zaroorat se farigh honey) ke liye bahar niklin, Hazrat Sauda (Raziallahu anha) jasaamat mein badi thin, jismani taur par aurton se unchi ( nazar aati) thin. jo shakhs unhein janta ho (pardey ke bawajood) uske liye makhfi nahi rehti thin, Hazrat umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein dekh kar kaha : Sauda (Raziallahu anha) ! Allah ki qism ! aap ham se posheeda nahi reh saktin isliye dekh lijiye aap kaisey bahar nikla karengi. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : Hazrat Sauda (Raziallahu anha) (ye suntey hi ( ultey paon lot aaein aur (us waqt) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere yahan raat ka khana tanaawul farma rahe they. aap ke hath mein gosht wali aik haddi thi wo andar aaein aur kehney lagin. Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ! main bahar nikli thi aur Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujhey is-is tarah kaha. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : usi waqt Allah Taala ne aap par wahi nazil farmai, phir aap se wahi ki kaifiyat zaayel ho gaee, haddi isi tarah aap ke hath mein thi, aap ne usey rakha nahi tha, aap ne farmaya : tum sab (ummahaatul-momeneen) ko ijazat de di gaee hai ke tum zarurat ke liye bahar ja sakti ho Abu-Bakar (ibne-Abi-Sheba) ki riwayat mein hai : unka jism aurton se uncha tha Abu-Bakar ne apni hadis (ki sanad) mein ye izafa kya : to Hisham ne kaha : aap ka maqsud qazaey-hajat (zaroorat se farigh honey) ke liye janey se tha."
"5787","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba aur abu-Kuraib ne kaha : hamein abu-Usama ne Hisham se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : parda ham par laagu ho janey ke baad Hazrat Sauda (Raziallahu anha) qazaey-hajat (zaroorat se farigh honey) ke liye bahar niklin, Hazrat Sauda (Raziallahu anha) jasaamat mein badi thin, jismani taur par aurton se unchi ( nazar aati) thin. jo shakhs unhein janta ho (pardey ke bawajood) uske liye makhfi nahi rehti thin, Hazrat umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein dekh kar kaha : Sauda (Raziallahu anha) ! Allah ki qism ! aap ham se posheeda nahi reh saktin isliye dekh lijiye aap kaisey bahar nikla karengi. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : Hazrat Sauda (Raziallahu anha) (ye suntey hi ( ultey paon lot aaein aur (us waqt) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere yahan raat ka khana tanaawul farma rahe they. aap ke hath mein gosht wali aik haddi thi wo andar aaein aur kehney lagin. Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ! main bahar nikli thi aur Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujhey is-is tarah kaha. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : usi waqt Allah Taala ne aap par wahi nazil farmai, phir aap se wahi ki kaifiyat zaayel ho gaee, haddi isi tarah aap ke hath mein thi, aap ne usey rakha nahi tha, aap ne farmaya : tum sab (ummahaatul-momeneen) ko ijazat de di gaee hai ke tum zarurat ke liye bahar ja sakti ho Abu-Bakar (ibne-Abi-Sheba) ki riwayat mein hai : unka jism aurton se uncha tha Abu-Bakar ne apni hadis (ki sanad) mein ye izafa kya : to Hisham ne kaha : aap ka maqsud qazaey-hajat (zaroorat se farigh honey) ke liye janey se tha."
"5788","ibne-Numair ne kaha : Hisham ne hamein isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur kaha : wo aisi khatun thin ke unka jism logon se uncha (nazar aata) tha. (ye bhi) kaha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat ka khana tanaawul farma rahe they."
"5789","ibne-Numair ne kaha : Hisham ne hamein isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur kaha : wo aisi khatun thin ke unka jism logon se uncha (nazar aata) tha. (ye bhi) kaha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat ka khana tanaawul farma rahe they."
"5790","Ali-bin-Mus-hir ne Hisham se isi sanad ke sath hamein hadis bayan ki."
"5791","Ali-bin-Mus-hir ne Hisham se isi sanad ke sath hamein hadis bayan ki."
"5792","Aqeel-bin-Khalid ne ibne-Shahab se, unhon-ne Urwa-bin-Zubair se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyan jab raat ko qazaey-hajat (zaroorat se farigh honey) ke liye bahar nikaltiin to manasey ki taraf jati thin, wo door aik khuli , badi jagah hai. aur Hazrat Umar-bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye arz kartey rahtey they ke aap apni beeviyon ko parda karaaein , Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ( kisi hikmat ki bina par) aisa nahi kartey they, phir aik raat ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ahliya Hazrat Sauda-binte-Zama (Raziallahu anhu) isha ke waqt (qazaey-hajat (zaroorat se farigh honey) ke liye) bahar niklein, wo daraaz (lambi) qad khatun thin, to umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne us hirs mein ke hijaab nazil ho jaey, pukar kar unse kaha : Sauda ! ham ne aapko pehchan liya hai. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : is par Allah Taala ne hijaab nazil farma diya."
"5793","Aqeel-bin-Khalid ne ibne-Shahab se, unhon-ne Urwa-bin-Zubair se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyan jab raat ko qazaey-hajat (zaroorat se farigh honey) ke liye bahar nikaltiin to manasey ki taraf jati thin, wo door aik khuli , badi jagah hai. aur Hazrat Umar-bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye arz kartey rahtey they ke aap apni beeviyon ko parda karaaein , Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ( kisi hikmat ki bina par) aisa nahi kartey they, phir aik raat ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ahliya Hazrat Sauda-binte-Zama (Raziallahu anhu) isha ke waqt (qazaey-hajat (zaroorat se farigh honey) ke liye) bahar niklein, wo daraaz (lambi) qad khatun thin, to umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne us hirs mein ke hijaab nazil ho jaey, pukar kar unse kaha : Sauda ! ham ne aapko pehchan liya hai. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : is par Allah Taala ne hijaab nazil farma diya."
"5794","Saleh ne ibne-Shahab se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"5795","Saleh ne ibne-Shahab se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"5796","abu-Zubair ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se khabar di, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : suno ! koi shakhs kisi shadi shuda aurat ke paas raat ko na rahe, siwaey-iske ke iska khawind ho ya mehram (ghair shadi shuda aurat ke paas rehna aur zyada sakhti se mana hai.)"
"5797","abu-Zubair ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se khabar di, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : suno ! koi shakhs kisi shadi shuda aurat ke paas raat ko na rahe, siwaey-iske ke iska khawind ho ya mehram (ghair shadi shuda aurat ke paas rehna aur zyada sakhti se mana hai.)"
"5798","Qutaiba-bin-Saeed aur Muhammad-bin-Rumeh ne kaha : hamein Leis ne Yazeed-bin-abi-Habib se khabar di, unhon-ne abu-al-khair se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aqba-bin-Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum ( ajnabi) aurton ke yahan janey se bacho . Ansar mein se aik shakhs ne kaha : Allah ke rasool ! dewar / jeth ke mutaalliq aap ka kya khayal hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : dewar / jeth to maut hai."
"5799","Qutaiba-bin-Saeed aur Muhammad-bin-Rumeh ne kaha : hamein Leis ne Yazeed-bin-abi-Habib se khabar di, unhon-ne abu-al-khair se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aqba-bin-Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum ( ajnabi) aurton ke yahan janey se bacho . Ansar mein se aik shakhs ne kaha : Allah ke rasool ! dewar / jeth ke mutaalliq aap ka kya khayal hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : dewar / jeth to maut hai."
"5800","Abdullah-bin-Wahab ne Amr-bin-Haris , Lais-bin-Sad aur Hewa-bin-shureh wghaira se riwayat ki ke Yazeed-bin-abi-Habib ne unhein isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat bayan ki."
"5801","Abdullah-bin-Wahab ne Amr-bin-Haris , Lais-bin-Sad aur Hewa-bin-shureh wghaira se riwayat ki ke Yazeed-bin-abi-Habib ne unhein isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat bayan ki."
"5802","ibne-Wahab ne kaha : maine Lais-bin-Sad se suna, keh rahe they : hamov ( dewar / jeth ( khawind ka bhai hai. ya khawind ke rishte-daaron mein us jaisa rishta rakhney waalaa, maslan : iska chacha zaad wghaira ."
"5803","ibne-Wahab ne kaha : maine Lais-bin-Sad se suna, keh rahe they : hamov ( dewar / jeth ( khawind ka bhai hai. ya khawind ke rishte-daaron mein us jaisa rishta rakhney waalaa, maslan : iska chacha zaad wghaira ."
"5804","Abdur-Rehman-bin-Juber ne kaha ke Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Amr-bin-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein hadis sunai ke banu-Hashim ke kuchh log Hazrat Asma binte-Umais (Raziallahu anhu) ke ghar gaey, phir Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) bhi aa gaey, Hazrat Asma (Raziallahu anha) us waqt unke nikah mein thin. unhon-ne un logon ko dekha to unhein na-gawar guzra . unhon-ne ye baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko batai , sath hi kaha : maine khair ke siwa kuchh nahi dekha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala ne (bhi) unhein (hazrat Asma binte-Umais (Raziallahu anhu) ko) us se bari qarar diya hai. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) member par khadey huey aur farmaya : aaj ke baad koi shakhs kisi aisi aurat ke paas na jaey jiska khawind ghar par na ho, siwaey-iske ke uske sath aik ya do log hon."
"5805","Abdur-Rehman-bin-Juber ne kaha ke Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Amr-bin-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein hadis sunai ke banu-Hashim ke kuchh log Hazrat Asma binte-Umais (Raziallahu anhu) ke ghar gaey, phir Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) bhi aa gaey, Hazrat Asma (Raziallahu anha) us waqt unke nikah mein thin. unhon-ne un logon ko dekha to unhein na-gawar guzra . unhon-ne ye baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko batai , sath hi kaha : maine khair ke siwa kuchh nahi dekha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala ne (bhi) unhein (hazrat Asma binte-Umais (Raziallahu anhu) ko) us se bari qarar diya hai. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) member par khadey huey aur farmaya : aaj ke baad koi shakhs kisi aisi aurat ke paas na jaey jiska khawind ghar par na ho, siwaey-iske ke uske sath aik ya do log hon."
"5806","Sabit Bunani ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (ghar se bahar) apni aik ahliya ke sath they, aap ke paas se aik shakhs guzra to aap ne usey bula liya , jab wo aaya to aap ne farmaya : aey falan ! ye meri falan biwi hai. us shakhs ne kaha : Allah ke rasool ! main kisi ke barey mein guman karta bhi to aap ke barey main to nahi kar sakta tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : shaitan insan ki ragon mein khoon ki tarah daudta hai."
"5807","Sabit Bunani ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (ghar se bahar) apni aik ahliya ke sath they, aap ke paas se aik shakhs guzra to aap ne usey bula liya , jab wo aaya to aap ne farmaya : aey falan ! ye meri falan biwi hai. us shakhs ne kaha : Allah ke rasool ! main kisi ke barey mein guman karta bhi to aap ke barey main to nahi kar sakta tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : shaitan insan ki ragon mein khoon ki tarah daudta hai."
"5808","Mamar ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Ali-bin-Husain se, unhon-ne Hazrat Safiya-binte-Huyi (Ummul-Momenin (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat ki, kaha : Ummul-Momenin Safiya-binte-Huyi (Raziallahu anhu) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aetikaf mein they, mein raat ko Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ziyaarat ko aai. maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baatein kin, phir main lot janey ko khadi hui to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi mujhey pahuncha dene ko mere sath khadey huey aur mera ghar Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ke makan mein tha. raah mein Ansar ke do aadmi miley jab unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha to wo jaldi-jaldii chalney lagey. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke thehro, ye Safiya-binte-Huyi (Raziallahu anhu) hai. wo donon boley ke Subhan-Allah ya Rasulullah ! (yani ham bhala aap par koi bad-gumaani kar saktey hain?) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ke shaitan insan ke badan mein khoon ki tarah phirtaa hai aur main dara ke kahin tumharey dil mein bura khayal na daley. (aur uski wjah se tum tabah ho)."
"5809","Mamar ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Ali-bin-Husain se, unhon-ne Hazrat Safiya-binte-Huyi (Ummul-Momenin (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat ki, kaha : Ummul-Momenin Safiya-binte-Huyi (Raziallahu anhu) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aetikaf mein they, mein raat ko Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ziyaarat ko aai. maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baatein kin, phir main lot janey ko khadi hui to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi mujhey pahuncha dene ko mere sath khadey huey aur mera ghar Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ke makan mein tha. raah mein Ansar ke do aadmi miley jab unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha to wo jaldi-jaldii chalney lagey. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke thehro, ye Safiya-binte-Huyi (Raziallahu anhu) hai. wo donon boley ke Subhan-Allah ya Rasulullah ! (yani ham bhala aap par koi bad-gumaani kar saktey hain?) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ke shaitan insan ke badan mein khoon ki tarah phirtaa hai aur main dara ke kahin tumharey dil mein bura khayal na daley. (aur uski wjah se tum tabah ho)."
"5810","Shuaib ne Zohri se riwayat ki, kaha : mujhey Ali-bin-Husain ne bataya ke unhein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ahliya mohtarma Hazrat Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke wo Ramazan ke aakhiri ashrey mein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke aetikaf ke doran masjid mein aap se milney aaein. unhon-ne ghadi bhar aap se baat ki, phir waapsi ke liye khadi ho gain. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi unko wapas chhodney ke liye khadey ho gaey. iske baad (Shuaib ne) Mamar ki hadis ke ham mana hadis bayan ki, magar unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : shaitan insan ke andar wahan pahunchta hai jahan khoon pahunchta hai. unhon-ne daudta hua nahi kaha."
"5811","Shuaib ne Zohri se riwayat ki, kaha : mujhey Ali-bin-Husain ne bataya ke unhein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ahliya mohtarma Hazrat Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke wo Ramazan ke aakhiri ashrey mein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke aetikaf ke doran masjid mein aap se milney aaein. unhon-ne ghadi bhar aap se baat ki, phir waapsi ke liye khadi ho gain. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi unko wapas chhodney ke liye khadey ho gaey. iske baad (Shuaib ne) Mamar ki hadis ke ham mana hadis bayan ki, magar unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : shaitan insan ke andar wahan pahunchta hai jahan khoon pahunchta hai. unhon-ne daudta hua nahi kaha."
"5812","imam Malik-bin-Anas ne Ishaq-bin-Abdullah-bin-abi-Talha se riwayat ki ke aqeel-bin-abi-Taalib (Raziallahu anhu) ke aazad karda ghulam abu-Murra ne unhein Hazrat abu-Waqid Lesi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat kartey huey khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid mein baithey they aur log Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they, itney mein teen aadmi aaey, do to seedhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur aik chala gaya. wo do jo aaey unmein se aik ne majlis mein jagah khali paai to wo wahan baith gaya aur doosra logon ke peechhey betha aur tesraa to peeth pher kar chal diya. jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farigh huey to farmaya kya main tum se teen aadmiyon ka haal na kahun? aik ne to Allah ke paas thikana liya to Allah ne usko jagah di aur doosrey ne (logon mein ghusney ki) sharm ki to Allah ne bhi us se sharm ki aur teesrey ne munh phera to Allah ne bhi us se munh pher liya."
"5813","imam Malik-bin-Anas ne Ishaq-bin-Abdullah-bin-abi-Talha se riwayat ki ke aqeel-bin-abi-Taalib (Raziallahu anhu) ke aazad karda ghulam abu-Murra ne unhein Hazrat abu-Waqid Lesi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat kartey huey khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid mein baithey they aur log Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they, itney mein teen aadmi aaey, do to seedhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur aik chala gaya. wo do jo aaey unmein se aik ne majlis mein jagah khali paai to wo wahan baith gaya aur doosra logon ke peechhey betha aur tesraa to peeth pher kar chal diya. jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farigh huey to farmaya kya main tum se teen aadmiyon ka haal na kahun? aik ne to Allah ke paas thikana liya to Allah ne usko jagah di aur doosrey ne (logon mein ghusney ki) sharm ki to Allah ne bhi us se sharm ki aur teesrey ne munh phera to Allah ne bhi us se munh pher liya."
"5814","Yahya-bin-abi-Kasir ne kaha ke Ishaq bin-Abdullah-bin-abi-Talha ne unhein isi sanad se usi ke ham mana hadis bayan ki."
"5815","Yahya-bin-abi-Kasir ne kaha ke Ishaq bin-Abdullah-bin-abi-Talha ne unhein isi sanad se usi ke ham mana hadis bayan ki."
"5816","Leis ne Naafe se unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : tum mein se koi shakhs kisi doosrey ko uski jagah se na uthaey ke phir wahan (khud) baith jaey."
"5817","Leis ne Naafe se unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : tum mein se koi shakhs kisi doosrey ko uski jagah se na uthaey ke phir wahan (khud) baith jaey."
"5818","Ubaidullah ne Naafe se hadis bayan ki unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : koi shakhs kisi doosrey shakhs ko uski jagah se na uthaey ke phir wahan baith jaey, balke khuley ho kar baitho aur wusat paida karo."
"5819","Ubaidullah ne Naafe se hadis bayan ki unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : koi shakhs kisi doosrey shakhs ko uski jagah se na uthaey ke phir wahan baith jaey, balke khuley ho kar baitho aur wusat paida karo."
"5820","abu-Rabe aur abu-Kamil ne kaha : hamein Hammad ne hadis bayan ki kaha : hamein Ayub ne hadis sunai. Yahya-bin-Habib ne kaha : hamein Rooh ne hadis sunai, Muhammad-bin-Raafe ne kaha : hamein Abdur-Razzaq ne hadis bayan ki, un donon (Rooh aur Abdur-Razzaq) ne ibne-Juraij se riwayat ki, Muhammad-bin-Raafe ne kaha : hamein ibne-abi-fidya ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : Suhak-bin-Usman ne khabar di, un sab (Ayub ibne-Juraij aur Suhak-bin-Usman) ne Naafe se unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Leis ki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki, unhon-ne us hadis mein : balke khuley ho kar baitho aur wusat paida karo ke alfaz bayan nahi kiye aur (ibne- Raafe ne) ibne-Juraij ki hadis mein ye izafa kiya : maine un (ibne-bin-Juraij) se puchha : Juma ke din? unhon-ne kaha : Juma mein aur uske ilawa bhi."
"5821","abu-Rabe aur abu-Kamil ne kaha : hamein Hammad ne hadis bayan ki kaha : hamein Ayub ne hadis sunai. Yahya-bin-Habib ne kaha : hamein Rooh ne hadis sunai, Muhammad-bin-Raafe ne kaha : hamein Abdur-Razzaq ne hadis bayan ki, un donon (Rooh aur Abdur-Razzaq) ne ibne-Juraij se riwayat ki, Muhammad-bin-Raafe ne kaha : hamein ibne-abi-fidya ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : Suhak-bin-Usman ne khabar di, un sab (Ayub ibne-Juraij aur Suhak-bin-Usman) ne Naafe se unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Leis ki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki, unhon-ne us hadis mein : balke khuley ho kar baitho aur wusat paida karo ke alfaz bayan nahi kiye aur (ibne- Raafe ne) ibne-Juraij ki hadis mein ye izafa kiya : maine un (ibne-bin-Juraij) se puchha : Juma ke din? unhon-ne kaha : Juma mein aur uske ilawa bhi."
"5822","abdullah ne Mamar se, unhon-ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Salim se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum mein se koi shakhs apne bhai ko uski jagah se na uthaey ke phir uski jagah par baith jaey. (Saalim ne kaha) Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ka ye tareeq tha ke koi shakhs unke liye (khud bhi) apni jagah se uthta to wo uski jagah par na baithtey they."
"5823","abdullah ne Mamar se, unhon-ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Salim se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum mein se koi shakhs apne bhai ko uski jagah se na uthaey ke phir uski jagah par baith jaey. (Saalim ne kaha) Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ka ye tareeq tha ke koi shakhs unke liye (khud bhi) apni jagah se uthta to wo uski jagah par na baithtey they."
"5824","Abdur-Razzaq ne kaha : Mamar ne hamein isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah khabar di."
"5825","Abdur-Razzaq ne kaha : Mamar ne hamein isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah khabar di."
"5828","abu-Awana aur Abdul-Azeez-bin-Muhammad donon ne Suhel se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum mein se koi shakhs khada ho aur abu-Awana ki hadis mein hai jab tum mein se koi shakhs apni jagah se khada ho. phir us jagah lot aaey to wahi us (jagah) ka zyada haqdaar hai."
"5829","abu-Awana aur Abdul-Azeez-bin-Muhammad donon ne Suhel se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum mein se koi shakhs khada ho aur abu-Awana ki hadis mein hai jab tum mein se koi shakhs apni jagah se khada ho. phir us jagah lot aaey to wahi us (jagah) ka zyada haqdaar hai."
"5830","Zenab binte-Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ne Ummul-Momenin Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke aik mukhannas unke yahaan maujood tha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi ghar par they wo Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ke bhai se kehney laga : Abdullah-bin-Ubai Umayya ! agar kal (kalaan ko) Allah Taala tum logon ko Taaif par fateh ata farmaai to main tumhen Ghelaan ki beti ( baadiya-binte- Ghelaan (ka pata bataunga wo char silwaton ke sath samney aati hai (samney se jism par char silwatein padti hain) aur aath (8) silwaton ke sath peeth pher kar jati hai. (intihai farba jism ki hai) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uski ye baat sun li to aap ne farmaya : ye (mukhannas) tumharey yahaan dakhil na hua karein."
"5831","Zenab binte-Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ne Ummul-Momenin Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke aik mukhannas unke yahaan maujood tha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi ghar par they wo Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ke bhai se kehney laga : Abdullah-bin-Ubai Umayya ! agar kal (kalaan ko) Allah Taala tum logon ko Taaif par fateh ata farmaai to main tumhen Ghelaan ki beti ( baadiya-binte- Ghelaan (ka pata bataunga wo char silwaton ke sath samney aati hai (samney se jism par char silwatein padti hain) aur aath (8) silwaton ke sath peeth pher kar jati hai. (intihai farba jism ki hai) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uski ye baat sun li to aap ne farmaya : ye (mukhannas) tumharey yahaan dakhil na hua karein."
"5832","Urwa ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyon ke paas aik mukhannas aaya karta tha aur paak beeviyon (Raziallahu anhu) usey jinsi maamlaat se anjaan samjha karti thin. farmaya : aik din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laye aur wo aap ki aik ahliya ke yahan betha hua aik aurat ki tareef kar raha tha wo kehney laga : jab wo aati hai to char silwaton ke sath aati hai aur jab peeth pherti hai to aath (8) silwaton ke sath peeth pherti hai. is par Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kya main dekh nahi raha ke jo kuchh yahan hai usey sab pata hai. ye log tumharey paas na aaya karein. to unhon ( ummehaatul-moominin (Raziallahu anhu)) ne us se parda kar liya."
"5833","Urwa ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyon ke paas aik mukhannas aaya karta tha aur paak beeviyon (Raziallahu anhu) usey jinsi maamlaat se anjaan samjha karti thin. farmaya : aik din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laye aur wo aap ki aik ahliya ke yahan betha hua aik aurat ki tareef kar raha tha wo kehney laga : jab wo aati hai to char silwaton ke sath aati hai aur jab peeth pherti hai to aath (8) silwaton ke sath peeth pherti hai. is par Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kya main dekh nahi raha ke jo kuchh yahan hai usey sab pata hai. ye log tumharey paas na aaya karein. to unhon ( ummehaatul-moominin (Raziallahu anhu)) ne us se parda kar liya."
"5834","Hisham ke walid (Urwa) ne Hazrat Asma-binte-abi-Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne (hazrat Asma (Raziallahu anha)) ne kaha : Hazrat Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujh se nikah kiya to unke paas aik ghodey ke siwa na kuchh maal tha, na ghulam tha, na koi aur cheez thi. unke ghodey ko main hi chara dalti thi unki taraf se uski saari zimme-dari main sambhaalti. uski nigahdaasht (dekhbhaal) karti unke pani laney waley oont ke liye khajoor ki guthliyaan todti aur usey khilati main hi (us par) pani laati main hi unka pani ka dol seeti, aata goondhti, main achhi tarah roti nahi bana sakti thi to Ansar ki khawaateen mein se meri padaus mere liye roti bana detin, wo sachchi (dosti wali) auratein thin, unhon-ne ( Asma (Raziallahu anha) ( ne kaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ko zamin ka jo tukda ata farmaya tha wahan se apne sar par guthliyaan rakh kar laati ye (zameen) taqriban do tehai farsakh (taqriban 3.35 km) ki masafat par thi. kaha : aik din main aa rahi thi guthliyaan mere sar par thin to main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mili aap ke sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) mein se kuchh log aap ke sath they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey bulaya, phir awaz se oont ko bitha ne lagey taake (guthliyon ka bojh darmyan mein rakhtey huey) mujhey apne peechhey bitha lein. unhon-ne (hazrat Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ko mukhaatab kartey huey) kaha : mujhey sharm aai mujhey tumhari ghairat bhi malum thi to unhon (Zubair (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : Allah janta hai ke tumhara apne sar par guthliyon ka bojh uthana Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath sawar honey se zyada sakht hai. kaha : ( yahi kaifiyat rahi ( yahan tak ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne mere paas ( Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ata karda , hadis : 5693 .) aik kaneez bhijwaa di aur us ne mujh se ghodey ki zimme-dari ley li. (mujhey aisa laga ( jaisey unhon-ne mujhey (ghulaami se) aazad kara diya hai."
"5835","Hisham ke walid (Urwa) ne Hazrat Asma-binte-abi-Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne (hazrat Asma (Raziallahu anha)) ne kaha : Hazrat Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujh se nikah kiya to unke paas aik ghodey ke siwa na kuchh maal tha, na ghulam tha, na koi aur cheez thi. unke ghodey ko main hi chara dalti thi unki taraf se uski saari zimme-dari main sambhaalti. uski nigahdaasht (dekhbhaal) karti unke pani laney waley oont ke liye khajoor ki guthliyaan todti aur usey khilati main hi (us par) pani laati main hi unka pani ka dol seeti, aata goondhti, main achhi tarah roti nahi bana sakti thi to Ansar ki khawaateen mein se meri padaus mere liye roti bana detin, wo sachchi (dosti wali) auratein thin, unhon-ne ( Asma (Raziallahu anha) ( ne kaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ko zamin ka jo tukda ata farmaya tha wahan se apne sar par guthliyaan rakh kar laati ye (zameen) taqriban do tehai farsakh (taqriban 3.35 km) ki masafat par thi. kaha : aik din main aa rahi thi guthliyaan mere sar par thin to main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mili aap ke sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) mein se kuchh log aap ke sath they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey bulaya, phir awaz se oont ko bitha ne lagey taake (guthliyon ka bojh darmyan mein rakhtey huey) mujhey apne peechhey bitha lein. unhon-ne (hazrat Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ko mukhaatab kartey huey) kaha : mujhey sharm aai mujhey tumhari ghairat bhi malum thi to unhon (Zubair (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : Allah janta hai ke tumhara apne sar par guthliyon ka bojh uthana Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath sawar honey se zyada sakht hai. kaha : ( yahi kaifiyat rahi ( yahan tak ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne mere paas ( Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ata karda , hadis : 5693 .) aik kaneez bhijwaa di aur us ne mujh se ghodey ki zimme-dari ley li. (mujhey aisa laga ( jaisey unhon-ne mujhey (ghulaami se) aazad kara diya hai."
"5836","ibne-abi-Mulaika ne kaha ke Hazrat Asma (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kiya ke main ghar ki khidmaat sar anjam de kar Hazrat Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat karti thi, unka aik ghoda tha, main uski dekh bhaal karti thi, mere liye ghar ki khidmaat mein se ghodey ki nigahdaasht (dekhbhal) se badh kar koi aur khidmat zyada sakht na thi. main uske liye chaara laati, uski har zarurat ka khayal rakhti aur uski nigahdaasht karti , kaha : phir unhein aik khaadima mil gaee, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas kuchh qaidi aaey to aap ne unke liye aik khaadima ata kar di. kaha is ne mujh se ghodey ki nigahdaasht (ki zimme-dari ( sanbhaal li aur mujh se bahut bada bojh hata liya. mere paas aik aadmi aaya aur kaha : umme-abdullaah ! main aik faqeer aadmi hun : mera dil chahta hai ke main aap ke ghar ke saaey mein (baith kar saudaa) bech liya karun. unhon-ne kaha : agar maine tumhen ijazat de di to Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) inkar kar dengey. jab Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) maujood hon to (us waqt) aa kar mujh se ijazat maangna, phir wo shakhs (hazrat Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ki maujoodgi mein) aaya aur kaha : umme-abdullaah ! main aik faqeer aadmi hun aur chahta hun ke main aap ke ghar ke saaey mein (baith kar kuchh) bech liya karun unhon (Hazrat Asma (Raziallahu anha) ( ne jawab diya : Madiney main tumharey liye mere ghar ke siwa aur koi ghar nahi hai? to Hazrat Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse kaha : tumhen kya hua hai, aik faqeer aadmi ko saudaa bechney se rok rahi ho? wo bechney laga, yahan tak ke usne kafi kamaai kar li, maine wo khaadima usey bech di. Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) andar aaey to us khaadima ki qeemat meri god mein padi thi, unhon-ne kaha, ye mujhey hiba kar do. to unhon-ne kaha : main isko sadqa kar chuki hun."
"5837","ibne-abi-Mulaika ne kaha ke Hazrat Asma (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kiya ke main ghar ki khidmaat sar anjam de kar Hazrat Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat karti thi, unka aik ghoda tha, main uski dekh bhaal karti thi, mere liye ghar ki khidmaat mein se ghodey ki nigahdaasht (dekhbhal) se badh kar koi aur khidmat zyada sakht na thi. main uske liye chaara laati, uski har zarurat ka khayal rakhti aur uski nigahdaasht karti , kaha : phir unhein aik khaadima mil gaee, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas kuchh qaidi aaey to aap ne unke liye aik khaadima ata kar di. kaha is ne mujh se ghodey ki nigahdaasht (ki zimme-dari ( sanbhaal li aur mujh se bahut bada bojh hata liya. mere paas aik aadmi aaya aur kaha : umme-abdullaah ! main aik faqeer aadmi hun : mera dil chahta hai ke main aap ke ghar ke saaey mein (baith kar saudaa) bech liya karun. unhon-ne kaha : agar maine tumhen ijazat de di to Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) inkar kar dengey. jab Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) maujood hon to (us waqt) aa kar mujh se ijazat maangna, phir wo shakhs (hazrat Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ki maujoodgi mein) aaya aur kaha : umme-abdullaah ! main aik faqeer aadmi hun aur chahta hun ke main aap ke ghar ke saaey mein (baith kar kuchh) bech liya karun unhon (Hazrat Asma (Raziallahu anha) ( ne jawab diya : Madiney main tumharey liye mere ghar ke siwa aur koi ghar nahi hai? to Hazrat Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse kaha : tumhen kya hua hai, aik faqeer aadmi ko saudaa bechney se rok rahi ho? wo bechney laga, yahan tak ke usne kafi kamaai kar li, maine wo khaadima usey bech di. Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) andar aaey to us khaadima ki qeemat meri god mein padi thi, unhon-ne kaha, ye mujhey hiba kar do. to unhon-ne kaha : main isko sadqa kar chuki hun."
"5838","Malik ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab teen shakhs (maujood) hon to aik ko chhod kar do aadmi aapas mein sargoshi na karein."
"5839","Malik ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab teen shakhs (maujood) hon to aik ko chhod kar do aadmi aapas mein sargoshi na karein."
"5840","Ubaidullah, Lais-bin-Sad, Ayub (sakhtiyan) aur Ayub-bin-Musa un sab ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Malik ki hadis ke ham mana riwayat ki."
"5841","Ubaidullah, Lais-bin-Sad, Ayub (sakhtiyan) aur Ayub-bin-Musa un sab ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Malik ki hadis ke ham mana riwayat ki."
"5842","Mansoor ne abu-Waail (Shaqeeq) se, unhon-ne Abdullah (bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum teen log (eik saath) ho to aik ko chhod kar do aadmi aapasi sargoshi na karein. yahan tak ke tum bahut se logon mein mil jao, kahin aisa na ho ke ye (do ki sargoshi) usey ghamzada kar de."
"5843","Mansoor ne abu-Waail (Shaqeeq) se, unhon-ne Abdullah (bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum teen log (eik saath) ho to aik ko chhod kar do aadmi aapasi sargoshi na karein. yahan tak ke tum bahut se logon mein mil jao, kahin aisa na ho ke ye (do ki sargoshi) usey ghamzada kar de."
"5844","abu-Muawiya ne Aamash se, unhon-ne Shaqiq se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah (bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum teen log ho to apne sathi ko chhod kar do aapas mein sargoshi na karein kyonke ye cheez usko ghamzada kar degi."
"5845","abu-Muawiya ne Aamash se, unhon-ne Shaqiq se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah (bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum teen log ho to apne sathi ko chhod kar do aapas mein sargoshi na karein kyonke ye cheez usko ghamzada kar degi."
"5846","Isa-bin-Yonus aur Sufiyan donon ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath (hadis bayan ki)."
"5847","Isa-bin-Yonus aur Sufiyan donon ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath (hadis bayan ki)."
"5848","Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ahliya Hazrat Aaisha Siddiqa (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : jab Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bimar hotey to Jibreel (Alaihissalam) aapko dam kartey, wo kehtey : Allah ke naam se, wo aapko bachaaey aur har bimari se shifa de aur hasad karne waley ke shar se, jab wo hasad karey aur nazar lagaaney wali har aankh ke shar se. ( aapko mehfooz rakhey.)"
"5849","Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ahliya Hazrat Aaisha Siddiqa (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : jab Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bimar hotey to Jibreel (Alaihissalam) aapko dam kartey, wo kehtey : Allah ke naam se, wo aapko bachaaey aur har bimari se shifa de aur hasad karne waley ke shar se, jab wo hasad karey aur nazar lagaaney wali har aankh ke shar se. ( aapko mehfooz rakhey.)"
"5850","abu-Nazara ne Hazrat abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur kaha : aey Muhammad ! kya aap bimar ho gaey hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : haan. Hazrat Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ne ye kalimaat kahey : main Allah ke naam se aapko dam karta hun, har cheez se ( hifazat ke liye) jo aapko takleef de, har nafs aur har hasad karne wali aankh ke shar se, Allah aapko shifa de, mein Allah ke naam se aapko dam karta hun."
"5851","abu-Nazara ne Hazrat abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur kaha : aey Muhammad ! kya aap bimar ho gaey hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : haan. Hazrat Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ne ye kalimaat kahey : main Allah ke naam se aapko dam karta hun, har cheez se ( hifazat ke liye) jo aapko takleef de, har nafs aur har hasad karne wali aankh ke shar se, Allah aapko shifa de, mein Allah ke naam se aapko dam karta hun."
"5852","Hammam-bin-Munabba ne kaha : ye hadisein hain jo hamein Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat kin, unhon-ne bahut si hadisein bayan kin, unmein se aik ye hai : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : nazar haq (Sabit shuda baat) hai."
"5853","Hammam-bin-Munabba ne kaha : ye hadisein hain jo hamein Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat kin, unhon-ne bahut si hadisein bayan kin, unmein se aik ye hai : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : nazar haq (Sabit shuda baat) hai."
"5854","Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : nazar haq (Sabit shuda baat) hai, agar koi aisi cheez hoti jo taqdeer par sabqat ley ja sakti to nazar sabqat ley jati aur jab (nazare-bad ke ilaaj ke liye) tum se ghusl karne ke liye kaha jaey to ghusl kar lo."
"5855","Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : nazar haq (Sabit shuda baat) hai, agar koi aisi cheez hoti jo taqdeer par sabqat ley ja sakti to nazar sabqat ley jati aur jab (nazare-bad ke ilaaj ke liye) tum se ghusl karne ke liye kaha jaey to ghusl kar lo."
"5856","ibne-Numair ne Hisham se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par bani-zuraiq ke aik Yahudi Labeed-bin-A'sam ne jaadoo kiya. yahan tak ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khayal aata ke main ye kaam kar raha hun halanke wo kaam kartey na they. aik din ya aik raat Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua ki, phir dua ki, phir farmaya ke aey Aaisha ! tujhey malum hua ke Allah jal jalaala ne mujhey wo batla diya jo maine us se poochha? . mere paas do aadmi aaey, aik mere sar ke paas betha aur doosra paon ke paas (wo donon Farishtey they) jo sar ke paas betha tha, us ne doosrey se kaha jo paon ke paas betha tha us ne sar ke paas baithey huey se kaha ke is shakhs ko kya bimari hai? wo bola ke is par jaadoo hua hai. usne kaha ke kis ne jaadoo kya hai? wo bola ke Labeed-bin-A'sam ne. phir usne kaha ke kis mein jaadoo kiya hai? wo bola ke kanghi mein aur un baalon mein jo kanghi se jhadey aur nar khajoor ke gaabhey ke reshey mein. usne kaha ke ye kahan rakha hai? wo bola ke zi-arwaan ke kunein mein. Ummul-Momenin Aaisha Siddiqa (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne chand ashaab ke sath us kunein par gaey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey Aaisha ! Allah ki qism us kunein ka pani aisa tha jaisey mahndi ka zalaal (nichod) aur wahan ke khajoor ke darakht aisey they jaisey shaitanon ke sar . maine arz kiya ke ya Rasulullah ! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usko jalaa kyon nahi diya? (yani wo jo baal wghaira nikley) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey to Allah ne theek kar diya, ab mujhey logon mein fasad bhadkana bura malum hua, to maine hukm diya aur wo dafn kar diya gaya."
"5857","ibne-Numair ne Hisham se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par bani-zuraiq ke aik Yahudi Labeed-bin-A'sam ne jaadoo kiya. yahan tak ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khayal aata ke main ye kaam kar raha hun halanke wo kaam kartey na they. aik din ya aik raat Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua ki, phir dua ki, phir farmaya ke aey Aaisha ! tujhey malum hua ke Allah jal jalaala ne mujhey wo batla diya jo maine us se poochha? . mere paas do aadmi aaey, aik mere sar ke paas betha aur doosra paon ke paas (wo donon Farishtey they) jo sar ke paas betha tha, us ne doosrey se kaha jo paon ke paas betha tha us ne sar ke paas baithey huey se kaha ke is shakhs ko kya bimari hai? wo bola ke is par jaadoo hua hai. usne kaha ke kis ne jaadoo kya hai? wo bola ke Labeed-bin-A'sam ne. phir usne kaha ke kis mein jaadoo kiya hai? wo bola ke kanghi mein aur un baalon mein jo kanghi se jhadey aur nar khajoor ke gaabhey ke reshey mein. usne kaha ke ye kahan rakha hai? wo bola ke zi-arwaan ke kunein mein. Ummul-Momenin Aaisha Siddiqa (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne chand ashaab ke sath us kunein par gaey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey Aaisha ! Allah ki qism us kunein ka pani aisa tha jaisey mahndi ka zalaal (nichod) aur wahan ke khajoor ke darakht aisey they jaisey shaitanon ke sar . maine arz kiya ke ya Rasulullah ! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usko jalaa kyon nahi diya? (yani wo jo baal wghaira nikley) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey to Allah ne theek kar diya, ab mujhey logon mein fasad bhadkana bura malum hua, to maine hukm diya aur wo dafn kar diya gaya."
"5858","abu-Kuraib ne kaha : hamein abu-Usama ne hadis bayan ki, kaha, hamein Hisham ne apne walid se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jaadoo kiya gaya. uskey baad abu-Kuraib ne waqiey ki tafseelaat samet ibne-Numair ki hadis ki tarah hadis bayan ki aur is mein kaha : phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kuwein ki taraf tashrif liye gaey, usey dekha, us kuwein par khajoor ke darakht they (jinhein kisi zamaney mein kuwein ke pani se sairaab kiya jata hoga) unhon (hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha)) ne kaha : maine kaha : Allah ke rasool ! usey nikaalein (aur jalaa dein) abu-Kuraib ne : aap ne usey jalaa kyon na diya? ke alfaz nahi kahey aur ye alfaz (bhi) bayan nahi kiye : maine uske barey mein hukm diya to usko paat diya gaya."
"5859","abu-Kuraib ne kaha : hamein abu-Usama ne hadis bayan ki, kaha, hamein Hisham ne apne walid se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jaadoo kiya gaya. uskey baad abu-Kuraib ne waqiey ki tafseelaat samet ibne-Numair ki hadis ki tarah hadis bayan ki aur is mein kaha : phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kuwein ki taraf tashrif liye gaey, usey dekha, us kuwein par khajoor ke darakht they (jinhein kisi zamaney mein kuwein ke pani se sairaab kiya jata hoga) unhon (hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha)) ne kaha : maine kaha : Allah ke rasool ! usey nikaalein (aur jalaa dein) abu-Kuraib ne : aap ne usey jalaa kyon na diya? ke alfaz nahi kahey aur ye alfaz (bhi) bayan nahi kiye : maine uske barey mein hukm diya to usko paat diya gaya."
"5860","Khalid-bin-Haaris ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Hisham-bin-Zaid se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke aik Yahudi aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik zahar aalud (pakki hui) bakri lekar aai, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usmein se kuchh (gosht khaya) ( aapko iske zahar aalud honey ka pataa chal gaya) to us aurat ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas laya gaya. aap ne us aurat se us (zahar) ke barey mein puchha to usne kaha : (naauzubillah !) main aapko qatl karna chahti thi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala aisa nahi karega ke tumhen is baat par tasallut ( ikhtiyar ( de dey . unhon ( Anas (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : ya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ( tumhen ( mujh par) tasallut de dey .) unhon ( Anas (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : sahaba (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) ne kaha : kya ham usey qatl na kar dein ? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : nahi. unhon ( Anas (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : to main ab bhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke munh mubarak ke androoni hissey mein uskey asaraat ko pehchanta hun."
"5861","Khalid-bin-Haaris ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Hisham-bin-Zaid se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke aik Yahudi aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik zahar aalud (pakki hui) bakri lekar aai, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usmein se kuchh (gosht khaya) ( aapko iske zahar aalud honey ka pataa chal gaya) to us aurat ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas laya gaya. aap ne us aurat se us (zahar) ke barey mein puchha to usne kaha : (naauzubillah !) main aapko qatl karna chahti thi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala aisa nahi karega ke tumhen is baat par tasallut ( ikhtiyar ( de dey . unhon ( Anas (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : ya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ( tumhen ( mujh par) tasallut de dey .) unhon ( Anas (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : sahaba (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) ne kaha : kya ham usey qatl na kar dein ? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : nahi. unhon ( Anas (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : to main ab bhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke munh mubarak ke androoni hissey mein uskey asaraat ko pehchanta hun."